<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- USHAMA NT</book>
  <para style="h">Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yahana</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yoh</para>
  <para style="mt2">ANABARE A TUSONGO NA WA</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yohana</para>
  <para style="imt">E CHIBAGANO</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s1">Beherya Bene Be Panga Muhondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Tun na Jigu o duniya azhe behenrya, behenrya henda be yo taba na Onhon, behenrya bene henda Onhon ne. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Beherya bene ton na Jigu be yo taba na Onhon. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Bando beb ne ab shi ko nya kuchi, henda a za ko nya bando ene e ab shi ene ba taba na eb ba. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Beherya bene beb bish repitu remuhondo, henda muhondo mune mob mush tubang wo ato. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Tubanga tobe bangaryatumaga na so tush, ama tush to pwa su reto re tubanga ba.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Onhon o tumane na butom bo ob, bone bwaba ogage Yohana. <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />Bone bo kore bo zwammagaa ato mahinda ma tubanga, zwam bando ezwamagaa eb ato kuchi a hoge anabare a tubanga a yaje. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Ba Yohana ebe shi tubanga tune ba, ama e kore ne zwam e zwamga anabare a tubanga tone. <verse eid="JHN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Tubanga to mahinda tone to kore na duniya to bangaryatome ato kuchi.<verse eid="JHN 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Da behenrya bini be yo na duniya, henda ko na ob ushi bando beb ne ab shi duniya, kuchi nanani duniya o daki bek ba. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Be kore tonge to beb, ama ato beb a cheu bek ba. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Ama kuchi ana a cheu Yesu, a yado henda na eb, e pa yek mahonre ashi awo Onhon. <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />A shiu awo a Onhon bando kingi ta ato a matage awo ba ko nupi o bot ba, ama bando o nupi o Onhon.<verse eid="JHN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Behenrya bete be maringe bot, pa beb besh rehuga ryashi na so nuti. tu hya e dan edanduwa ob, e dan edanduwa ene ish e bwa bo che bando o buch bob buba, Beherya bini henda be yo na iyi bura̱̱ na mahinda dinya. <verse eid="JHN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Yonaha e zwammagaa taaje o beb, e edanduwa henda bigwaba nyangya, &lt;&lt; Bone bushi bot bo gyam on zwammagaa na reto rebob gagu o gyam zwame nezwama, &lt; Bone bwa kore na nesa nimi bona hyange e dan edanduwa, zwam kape ana machia, bob bo yo pab.&gt; &gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Zwam udu o ehogo e yam e behenrya bini, Kuchi nuti gatu hi iyi bura̱̱ bando iyi bura̱̱. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Zwam Onhon o pa hadoba bando o Musa, ama iyi bura̱̱ na mahinda e sher bando Yesu Botʻbwakimga. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Aza bone bo tabo hya Onhon dududu. Ka bwa suba, bone bo yo ta Onhon oyo, bone henda boyo wo buchi, boba bo chibane oik.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tutom To Yohana e Shagu e Baptisma Na Reto re Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Uni henda oboshi tutom to Yohana, wato, gagu owa Yahudawa atoma pristochi na lawiyawa na Urushalima a kaba Yohana ko eb ishi ga. <verse eid="JHN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Pa Yohana e zwama yek mahinda e shiu mowondo ba, nyangya, &lt;&lt;Gyamshi Botʻbwakimga ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Pa Pritochi na Lawiyawa a kabaka ek, &lt;&lt;To, gab shi Iliya?&gt;&gt; Yohana nyange, &lt;&lt;A'a, ba eb ba,&gt;&gt; angya, &lt;&lt;Gab shi butoma botiya?&gt;&gt; Yohana nyange &lt;&lt;Ko&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Pristochi na Lawiyawa ange na Yohana, &lt;&lt;To, tuzwama ko gapshiga zwam tu hi iyi gatwa zwama ato a te ane a tu tuma nya gab on ogaga na reto na rebe?&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Yohana e chane yek nyange naba,&lt;&lt; Gyamshi bigwaba be bot mai bene be on ogo na uzanga, bebe zwammagaa, &lt;E banbige yena o Botʻbutuwaga honzhe o bob bwa swabo,&gt; Ta echibano e butom Ishaya nyange.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Ab henda, parisiyawa ne a tuma yek, <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />Pa ana ab tuma a kaba Yohana angya, &lt;&lt;Shi gab shi Botʻbwakimga ba, ba Eliya ba, ba butom bo te ba, zwam nya gab on shagyaga ato Baptisma?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Pa yohana e chane nyange,&lt;&lt;Gyam kam na mani gyam shagi Baptisma ama azhe bot boink bando nuhi boyo yesane bando numi bone bo gahi daki ba. <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />Bob ne bo on kore na Yesa nimi bone bo ko anini a otak obob gyam dama yachig ba. <verse eid="JHN 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Kuchi uni ashi na tonge to Betanya, wo onhwanho oraga shiraga na hiro o rwaga o urdun, pane pa Yahaya e raga shagyaga ato Baptisma.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Eshe Edumaga e Onhon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Na bungo o bunge Yohana e hya Yesu e be kore wo eb, pa Yohana nyange ene ishi e gyame zwama, &lt;&lt;Hingyana, bone bu shi edamaga e Onhon, bone bwa zhangu turiya to ato duniya! <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Ene ishi e gyam Yonaha na raga shaga taaje nezwama, &lt;&lt;Bo mai bo on kore na yesa nimi, bone bushi bo tuwaga nabumi, zwama da bu ka yo kame aka machie gyam&gt;. <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Na daki ko eb ishi ga ba, ama na kore ne shagiu Baptisma zwam a chibano ek wo ato eb Isra'ila.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Yohana ishi uni taaje na reto re Yesu nyangya, &lt;&lt;Na hya uhunchi obe kazhiya ta Ihurugu wari na turwana, e kazhiya wo Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Da kam, na daki ek ba, se de bone bona tuma ishi Baptisma na mani, bob bona zwama, &lt;Bone bo gab hya uhunchi obe kazhiya wo bob obe henda tanaga wo kingi ka bob, bob ne bwashi Baptisma na uhunchi o Onhon.&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Yohana nyange, Na hya boik henda,&gt;&gt; henda na on kame zwammagaa nezwama, &lt;&lt;Eb ishi bwa bo Onhon.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu e Yinga Aswabo A bune Eb a Jigu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Na bungu o bunge henda, Yohana eb yinsa ne na aswabo a eb ryariya. <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />Yohana e be yingyaga Yesu ebe shi tuhano pa Yohana nyange, &lt;&lt;E hya, edumaga e onhon!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Na aswabo a te a Yohana ryaryi a hoge Yohana e zwame nani naba swabe Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Yesu e mai bariki e hya yek a be swabi ek, pa Yesu nyange naba, &lt;&lt; nya gahi on yingyaga!&gt;&gt; Ange na Yesu, &lt;&lt;Gab Rabbi, wato, Umarumi, pa gab yo shani?&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Pa Yesu nyange na aswabo ani, &lt;&lt; Kuryanji e hya.&gt;&gt; Pa yek a karege a hya wo Yesu e shani, yek henda a hurumi pate, taba na eba. gagu o biroma be nashi henda be rombe ne. <verse eid="JHN 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Boink bando ryaryi a te ana a hoge taaje o Yohana yek henda a swabe Yesu, bob ne Andarawus buhunwa bo Bitrus. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Pa Andarawus a rwage hya buhuwa bo ab Bitrus ange na beb, &lt;&lt; Tu hya Botʻbwakimga.&gt;&gt; wato &lt;&lt; Kristi&gt;&gt;. <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Kapaba ab a zhange Bitrus wo Yesu. Yesu e yingyane Bitrus, nyange, &lt;&lt; Wato gab shi Saminu bwa bo Yohana? A bu ogago Kepas,&gt;&gt; wato Bitrus.<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu e Yinga Plibus Na Nata'ala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Na bungu o bunge henda pa Yesu emakimga nya koro shepo o Galili. Pa eb e bangi Pilibus, nyange na eb, &lt;&lt; Na swabya&gt;&gt;. <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Pilibus henda ishi bot bo Betsaida, shepo o Andarawus na Bitrus. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Pilibus e bangi Nata'ala, nyange na ab, &lt;&lt;Tu bangu bone bo Musa o herange taaje o bob na so atak a hadoba a ob, hatuma henda a herango taaje o bob, wato Yesu banazare, bwa bo Yusupu. <verse eid="JHN 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Pa Nata'ala nyange na pilibus, &lt;&lt;Apwa hi iyi mai e bura̱ henda na tonge to Nazarata?&gt;&gt; Pa pilibus nyange na ab, &lt;&lt; Kurya de o hya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Yesu e hya Nata'ala e be kore wo eb, pa eb ishi taaje o eb nyange, &lt;&lt; E hya, Ba'isra'ila bo mahinda bone boza ha'inci!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Nata'ala ange na Yesu, &lt;&lt; Pa gab na daki gyam?&gt;&gt; Yesu e chane ek nyange, &lt;&lt; Tun pilibus e bu ogagewa, gagu o gab yo na hambi a eʻo itu, gyam bo hya!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Pa Nata'ala e chane Yesu ange, Gab Umarumi, gab shi bwa bo Onhon! Gab shi bugwam bo ato Isra'ila!&gt;&gt;. <verse eid="JHN 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Yesu e chane nyange, &lt;&lt; Wato, zwam gyam bo zwama nezwama nabo hya na hambi a eʻo itu gab tane mahinda? Ai, bwa hya iyi mai etuwaga ene e hyange iri ni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Yesu henda nyange na ab, &lt;&lt; Lalle tamahinda na on kame zwammagaa, nya hya turwana toma sabchiu, a tuma a bura̱̱ a hagamba a Onhon a be dande a be kazhiyaga wo bwa bo bot.<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ushiyana na kana o Galili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Oho o muget mo tato pabashi ushiyana na kana o tunge to Galili. Yinu Yesu ayo paba, <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />Paba gimbake Yesu na aswabo a bune eb wo ushiyana uni. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Na mani ma inabi ma hwagi, pa yini Yesu nyange na Yesu, &lt;&lt; Yeka zakana mani ma inabi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Yesu nyange na yini &lt;&lt; yini nami, taaje uni ushi na obe ba zwam nya gab kore wo gyam. Gagu numi ushiu ba&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Pa yini Yesu nyange na agyam, &lt;&lt; Kuchi ene eb nyange yishi gahishi.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Paba henda azhe mukimbu mutunihi mo hate iragi, bando al'ada a Yahudawa ai guzagu, ko nyama e ragare bando mukimbu mute mani ma mubobo buini.<verse eid="JHN 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Pa Yesu nyange na agyam ani, &lt;&lt; E shindagi mukembu mote na mani.&gt;&gt; pa yek shindagi moik pal. <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Katomo henda Yesu nyange naba, &lt;&lt; To, yanzu tugagenji, e shibkane buchi bo beganje.&gt;&gt; Paba shibke boik mani mane. <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />Na buchi begenje bo harpa mani mane maba ringya tamo maik manima inabi, bo daki henda bando ab hi maik ba ama agyam ane a toge mani mane ab a daki, e ogage bot bo ushiyana upo, <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />Nyange na bob, &lt;&lt;Ko ga mani ma inabi ma bura̱̱ maba rwago panga, kata ato swago, katomo henda ab shibke mane ma wutagewa ma Jigu bizagi. Ama gab swen mani ma inabi ma bizagi se yanzu!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Uni oboshi iyahyani a Yesu e Jigu na kana o tunge to galili, e chibano e dan edanduwa e eb. aswabo a bone eb henda a yado na eb. <verse eid="JHN 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Katomo nani pa Yesu e kore kaparnahum, Yesu na yini eb, na ahuwa eb, na henda aswabo a bone eb, pa yekashani pate muget murya.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Na So Egenga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Na gagu Begenje be ekacheu be Yahudawa be wutagwa, pa Yesu e kore urushalima. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Na so Egenga Yesu e hi ato esango e naa, na tami, na mutattapura, na henda ato ebarika̱gu e kurubi shani bando riuga ryasange a bob. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Pa Yesu e pyache shiduga she karya na kare ka hada, e uzangu yek kuchi na Egenga taba na tami niya na naa, Yesu e kwagu henda kurubi ni e ato ebarika̱gu, e gatago henda mutaburu mwaba kuchi. <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />Yesu nyange na ana a sango mutantapuru, &lt;&lt; E saga kuchi ete pani! Eta ringyatuma Egenga e buchi na bumi rihuga retosa na sange.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Pa aswabo a bone eb amabutare oyo herange na atak a Onhon nezwama, &lt;&lt; Tushibiya to Egenga nebe ereu mohondo na mumi dinya. <verse eid="JHN 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Pa ayahudawa a chane ek ange, &lt;&lt; Emai iyahyani e gabwa tu chibano nezwama gab zhe mahonre ma e sha e nani?&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Yesu e chane yek nyange, &lt;&lt; E huzhagi Egenga ete, gyamu henda nashigatume yek na muget mutato.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Yahudawa ange na Yesu, &lt;&lt; Se naba hi hashekara akwape nashi na utunihi a be shi rema re Egenga ini, gab henda na so muget mutato gabwa mashigatomo yek?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Ama Egenga ene e Yesu e on taaje kingi ka eb ne. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Zwamnani, ka Taaba anshigatumo ek bando ana a owagi, aswabo a bone eb ama butariya nezwama e zwamo nani, pa yeka yaje henda na nassi na taaje o Yesu e tabo zwame.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu e Daki so o koga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />To, gagu o Yesu e yo na Urushalima bando bigenje be ekacheu, ato dinya a yaje na reze reb, zwam e hyanu iyahyani a eb ishi. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Ama Yesu e yado na yek ba zwam eb e daki yek honzhe kuchi, <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />Eza ekudage nezwama ko ga bo zwama yek zwama ab, zwam eb reto reb e daki ene eyo na hakoko haba.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu Na Nikodimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />To, azhe boparisiye bo mai bo reze Nikodimu, e tuwaga e Yahudawa. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Nikodimu e kore wo Yesu na ageta nyange na Yesu, &lt;&lt; Gab bo tusha, tudaki gab shi Umarumi one o shere bando onhon, zwam aza bone bo pwashi iyahyani ene e gab onshi, se onhon ne oraga panga boik mahonre.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Yesu e chane ek nyangya, &lt;&lt; lelle tamahinda, na raga kabo zwammagaa, shi a matakano bot ba, bwa hya tugwama to onhon ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Nikodimu nyange na Yesu, &lt;&lt; Inga Taaba mato bot kate bo ungo? wato, bo pwa kamarigya na mukaba mo yini amatakana boik?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Yesu e chane Nikodimu nyangya, &lt;&lt; lelle tamahinda, na raga kabo zwammagaa shi a mato bot bando mani na uhunchi ba. Bwa pwa eshe tugwama to onhon ba. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Bot bone bo bot bo machie bushi bwa bo bot, bot bone bo uhunchi o machii bu shi bwa bo uhunchi. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Otasha iya hyani zwam gya nage na gab,&lt; Dole a mai mataka.&gt; <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Uhunchi onhon ne o panga muhonda mopo, uhunchi oyo ta phar one o raga huraga bando ob o kudage. Bo pwa hoge phar ama henda bo daki bando ob o sherebe ko bando ob owa koro ba. <verse eid="JHN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Pa Nikodimu e chane Yesu nyangya, &lt;&lt; higa ta ob owashi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Yesu e chane nukodimu nyange, &lt;&lt; ashe gab ma na gab shi Umarumi o Isra'ila, bo daku iri niya ba? <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Lelle tamahinda na raga kabo zwammagaa, ene gatu daki eba gatu raga zwammagaa, to on henda eshe ba ene e gatu hya, ama e wondo henda e yado na sheda nuti. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Shi na maishagi ba, higata gahya yado shi namai zwama taaje o turwana? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Aza bone bwatabo hyana wariya na turwana se bone bo kazhagi na turwana, wato bwa bo bot nbone bo yo na turwana. <verse eid="JHN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />Ta Musa o dande ahwa te na uzanga nani henda dole a dande bwa bo bot, <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />Zwam henda kuchi bone bo yada na bob, bo hi muhondo mo dududu. <verse eid="JHN 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />Zwam e kudago e Onhon o kudage duniya dinya har o pa bwa boink bo ob, zwam kuchi bone bo yado na bwa bo, ob bo ta u, se de bo hi mohondo mo dududu. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />zwam Onhon o tumana bwa bo oba zwam bo shirya hadoba ba, se de zwam duniya o hi e chago bando bob. <verse eid="JHN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />Kuchi ana a tanoso na bwa bo Onhon, a shereu yek hadoba ba ama ane henda a tanaso ba, arego a shereu yek hadoba, zwam a tanoso bando bwa boink bo Onhon ba. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Hadoba ani henda ab ne, tubanga to esowa duniya, Ama ato hyange kudaga tushi na tubanga, zwam enk a ba aza a bura̱̱ <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Kuchi bone bo shagu iyi bura̱̱ ba bo kudage tubanga ba, bo karwago bando tubanga tuni ba, zwam enk ab a ta sabcha. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Bone bo shagu henda iyi bura̱̱, bo korago bando tubanga, zwam a chibano enk a bob, nezwama, ene e bob bonshi a yo honzhe wo Onhon.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Na Yohana e Shagu e Baptisma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Na yesa o nani, Yesu na aswabo a bone eb a kore tonge to Yahudiya pate yek ishi muget chimu, a be shagi yek Baptisma. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Yohana henda ebe shagya ato Baptisma na ainon. Kusa na salima, zwam mani mayo dinya pate. Ato henda a raga ke karigyaga zwam a shagi yek Baptisma. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />Na gagu oni atano Yohana na zharo ba katomo. <verse eid="JHN 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Pa a mai aswabo a Yohana a kumbe muhawara na Bayahude bo mai zwam taaje o eguzhagu. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Pa aswbo a Yohana a kore wo Yohana ange na eb, &lt;&lt; Gab butusha, bone bo gahi yo taba na boba na zaat o hiro o rwaga o urdun bone henda gab na reto na rebe ma bo shedu boik, to a bona, bobe shaga Baptisma har koga na koga bo raga kuraga wo bob. <verse eid="JHN 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Pa Yohana e chane nyange, &lt;&lt; A za bone bo pwa hi ko nya se de bone bo Onhon o pa boik. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Gahi ma hato nahi e daki nezwama gyamwange nashi Botʻbwakimga ba, ama ana tuma gyam zwam e kimga yena o eb nya swabo. <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Bot bo bwaa bo ushiyana opo bushi bot bo ushiya opo. Bo chagiya bo bot bo ushiya opo henda bone bo yo yisane, bobe bake henda tage o bob, bo ragashi so chen dinya na e hogo e bigwaba be bot bo ushiyana opo. zwam nani so chen numi o shidu <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Yesu henda e raga kisanga tuwaga, gyam henda Yohana naraga nagi tuwaga.<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bone Bo Kore Wari Na Turwana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />Yesu ene kore wari na turwana bo hyange koga tuwaga kuchi. Ama bone bo kore pani na tonge bushi bo tonge, na henda bo raga shaga taaje o ene ishi e tonge, ama bone bo kore wari na turwana bo hyan koga kuchi. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />Yesu e zwama ene eb e hya na ene eb e hoge, henda aza bone bo yado na tutom to eb ba. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Kuchi bone bo yado na tutom to eb bo yado nezwama, Onhon ushi o tamahinda. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Zwam bone bo Onhon o tuma, taaje Onhon o bob bo raga zwammagaa, zwam Onhon o panga uhunchi ba na inhyaka ba. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Onhon Buchi bo kudage bwa buni, Onhon o tano henda ko nya na wa bob. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Bone bo tanoso wo bwa bob bo yo na muhondo mo dududu. Bone henda bo wondo eswabo bwa, bwa hi muhondo mo dududu ba, se de, so shiri o Onhon owa tabbatu wo bob dududu.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu Na Bwaa Bo Tonge to Samariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Na Parisyawa a hoge anabare Yesu e raga hyangu aswabo a bone eb, e raga shagyaga yek Baptisma hyange na Yohana. <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />Ko na obshi ba Yesu na reto re eb e raga shagya ga yek Baptisma ba, aswabo a bune eb ne, <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />Na Yesu e hoge ene e ato a raga zwammagaa pa eb e ge tonge to Yahudawa, e maringe tonge to Galili. <verse eid="JHN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Lelle now e swabe bando tonge to samariya <verse eid="JHN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Pa Yesu e kore shepo o mai na tonge to Samariya, tone twaba ogo saikar, kusa na tonge tone to Yakubu henda e pa bwa bo eb Yusupu. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Eyiu e Yakubu henda eyo pab. Zwam tuniba to tuhano, pa Yesu e shani na gongu eyiu gagu onhwanho na reto ne henda.<verse eid="JHN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Ab pab pa Bwaa bo tonge to samariya bo mai bo kore e tugo e mani pa Yesu nyange na bob, &lt;&lt; Na pana mani aiswa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />Aswabo a bone eb a eso shepo e sa e kuryago <verse eid="JHN 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Pa Basamariya buni bwange na Yesu, &lt;&lt; zwam nya gab bayahude bwana kaba mani ma tuswa, gyam bone bo gyamshi Basamariya?&gt;&gt; Zwam Yahudawa ama haregago ba na Samariyawa.<verse eid="JHN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Yesu e chane boik nyange, &lt;&lt; Shi buka daki e pano Onhon e suba, na henda bone bwange na gab, &lt;Na pana mani aiswa&gt;, ai, shi bo ka kaba boik, bob henda bwa bo pa mani ma e panga e muhondo mo dududu.&gt;&gt; .<verse eid="JHN 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Pa bwaa buni bwange na Yesu, &lt;&lt; Gab butusha, ai, buza iya tugage, eyiwa eni e kwaranchi. To, pa gab hi mani mate ma mohondo mo dududu? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Bo hyange kaka na kati Yakubu, bone bo tu gageu iyiwa iniya, har eb reto re'eb, na awo eb, na hamoga eb, ab su mani ma eba?&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Yesu e chane boik nyangya, &lt;&lt; Kuchi bone bo swago mani mate bwa hugaka tu'oware to mani. <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />Ama kuchi bone bo suwa mani mane ma gyamwa pa boik, bwa hugaka tu'oware ba dududu. mani mane ma gyamwa pa boik now mashi mane ma raga shirage ta mani ma iyu wo bob ko hwane, mabe shirage panga boik muhondo mo dududu&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Bwaa bone bwange na Yesu, &lt;&lt; Gab botusha, na pana mani mate, zwam ta hugakana tu'oware, eta raga henda kuraga paniya e toge maik.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Pa Yesu nyangye na bwaa, &lt;&lt; Karigya, kurya na garibu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Pa bwaa bone bo chane bwangya, &lt;&lt; Ai, naza bware.&gt;&gt; Yesu nyange na bob, &lt;&lt; Mahinda na mabe na gab zwame boza bware, <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />zwam bushiya are a ta, bone bo gahi yo taba yanzu, ba bwariya na bobe ba. pani kam bashiu mahinda.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Bwaa boni bwange na Yesu, &lt;&lt; Gab botusha, nagano gab shi butom bo Onhon. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Shikaka nashiti she tonge to Samariya a gyamato Onhon wo shama ete. ama gahi Yahudawa henda nyangya wo Urushalima ne rihuga ryaba gyamato Onhon suba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Pa Yesu nyangye na bwaa, &lt;&lt; Yini yaba, o yaje na gyamu, gagu owakore one o ato a pwa shagi onhn buchi tugyama ba, ko na te uniya, ko na Urushalima ba, <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Gahi ato a samariya raga shagyaga ene e gahi dakiwa̱ tugyama, gatu Yahudawa henda turaga shagyaga ene e gatu daki tugyama, zwama e chago eyo bando Yahudawa. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Ama gagu owakore, har ma ushiu, na ana shagu tugyama to mahinda yeka shagiu Buchi tugyama na so uhunchi, na mahinda henda, lelle henda iri ato aniya ab a Buchi bo on gembo. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Onhon ushi uhuchi, ana a oingiwa oik tugyama henda a shagi oik tugyama na mahonre ma uhunchi, na henda mahinda.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Pa bwaa bwange na Yesu, &lt;&lt; Na daki masihi ma oinkore, bone bwaba ogo Botʻbwakimga. Gagu eb e korwa henda, nya tuzwama konya.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Pa Yesu nyangye na bwaa, &lt;&lt; Gyam ne eb gyam bone bo gyam on taaje uni na gab.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Kapaba aswabo a bune eb a giya. yek ashi iyahyani ne hyanu e Yesu e be on taaje na bwaa. Ama henda aza bone bo zwamo ko nya na eba, &lt;&lt; Nya gab on gembo? Ko, Zwam nya gab on taaje na bwaa buniya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Zwamnani, pa bwaa bone bo ge ekembu e bob, bo maringe na shepo, bwange na ato. <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />&lt;&lt; Kuranji e hya bot buni bo na zwama ene e gyamwa taboshi kuchi! Shin, umbu ebe shi Botʻbwakimga?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Pa ato ge shepo a kore bando Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Ab nananiya pa aswabo a bone eb a kaba Yesu angya, &lt;&lt; Gab Umarumi, rya kuryago.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Ama Yesu nyange naba, &lt;&lt; Na zhe kuryago kone ko gahi dakiwa̱ iri kuba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Aswabo a bone eb ama zwama hato haba, &lt;&lt; Shin, bot mai bo shibkanya ek kuryago ne?&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Pa Yesu nyange na aswabo a bone eb, &lt;&lt; Kuryago nakumi kuba ne agetage ene Buchi na bumi bo kudage shagi bone bona to ma ene bob bo na tuma, henda e ehwagu enk a bob. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Ezhe ezwama ene e gahi raga zwammagaa giyatuma o ryanta̱ pyana nashi. Na raga kame zwammagaa, e yingyaga hasanga, e hya, a yinago o dama biguba̱. <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Buto bo biguba̱ bo hyangu ketope, bo zuranga henda ampane koro muhondo mo dududu, zwam bot bo tobero na bot bo biguba̱ yek a hoge so chen taba. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Taje uni ushi mahinda, &lt; Bot boink bwa biryago boink bwa guba.&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Ne me tuma biguba̱ be ene gahi shiu enk ba. Ato mai a shiu enk gahi henda e re maduru maba&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ato Samariyawa Dinya Na Shepo Nuni Atane so</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Hasamariyawa dinya a shepo ote a taneso wo Yesu zwam taaje o bwaa bote o bob bwange, &lt;&lt; Yesu ena zwama kuchi ene e gyamwa taboshi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Na asamariyawa a wuchi bando Yesu, pa yeka roki ek e shani bando owaba. Yesu e bunge henda karyagya paba. <verse eid="JHN 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Ato mai henda dinya Samariyawa hyange na ana a da ataneso zwam taaje o Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />Katomo pa asamariyawa ange na bwaa buni, &lt;&lt; Yamzu henda to tanoso, ba zwam ene e gab zwame suba ba, zwam gatu ma to hogo na hato nati, to yado henda nazwama bot bote bushi bot bwa ringichagi ato duniya.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu E Rumigyatum Bwa bo Bapade</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Yensa o muget mote muryagya pa Yesu e mashinge pate e kore tunge to Galili. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />Zwam Yesu reto re'eb e shiu ezwamo hatoma boza tuwaga na tonge to ba. <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Na Yesu e wuchi tonge to Galili, pa Agalilawa a che ek, zwam ab hya kuchi ene eb ishi na Urushalima gagu o bigenje be ekacheu, zwama ab ma a kore begenje bini.<verse eid="JHN 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Pa Yesu e kurwaka kana o tonge to Galili, wo eb e ringyatome mani mane ma inabi. Na kaparnahum henda azhe Bapade bo mai bone bo bwa bo bob bu rumagi. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Na e hago Yesu e shirya tonge to Yahudiya e maringya tonge to Galili, pa bob bo kore wo Yesu, bu roki Yesu nezwama e kore Kaparnahum e rumigyatumi bwa bo bob, zwam ek e nya u.<verse eid="JHN 4:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Yesu nyange na Bapade buni, &lt;&lt; Un ba mahyanu hyanu na iya hyani gahi hya ba, a za ta ba shi gahi tane sowa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Pa Bapade bote bwange na Yesu, &lt;&lt; Gab tubusha, kurya kape bwa nabumi bo now bo u ba.&gt;&gt; .<verse eid="JHN 4:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Yesu nyange na bapade, &lt;&lt; Sha tuhano na tobe, bwa na bobe bwa rumigiu!&gt;&gt;.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:50">Bapade bote henda bo yado na taaje o Yesu e zwama boik, bushi tuhano to bob. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Bapade buni bobeshi tuhano to bob pa bob bo maharage na agyam a bob,ange na bob, &lt;&lt; Bwa na bobe bo yo na muhondo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Pa bapade buni bo kaba yek gagu o bwa buni bo hine hoge erumigeu. pa agyam ani ange na bapade buni, &lt;&lt; Ahwa na biroma binka̱ be onhwanho e be rwage rumigi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Pa buchi bo bwa bo ma butare, gagu oni Yesu nyange na bob, &lt;&lt; Bwa na bobe boyo na muhondo.&gt;&gt; Eb na reto re'eb henda e tane mahinda, na ato yaba eb kuchi <verse eid="JHN 4:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />uni henda oboshi iyahyana aryari a Yesu ishi, na gewa Yesu e ge Yahudiya koro tonge to Galili.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu e rumigyatumi burumaga na awa a Betasda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Yesu henda e kore Urushalima gagu o begenje be Yahudawa <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Na Urushalima, kusa na eso e tami, azhe mani ma mai mane maba ogo mek betasda na kare ka Yahudawa, aringaci ek na shiraye she ta. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Na shiraye shite henda ana arumagagi amayawa rabtaga pab, aruba, na agunu, na anaswagi kingi. A absaga nezwama a bunjiga mani. <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />Zwam gagu butom bo hagamba bu raga kurage bo bunjiga mani. zwam henda kuchi bone bwarago esh a ta rwago bunjiga mani, bwaregi rumigya bando iri hone ne e bob buzhe. <verse eid="JHN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />pate henda azhe bot mai bone bo zhe hashekara akwape tato na tutato na hono. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Na Yesu e hya ek rabche, e daki henda e warago na hono ni, pa Yesu nyange na eb, &lt;&lt; Bo kudage abo rumigya tumi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Bo ne bo rumagi bo chane Yesu bwangye, &lt;&lt; Gab butusha, ai, naza bone bwana tazhikiwa na so mani gagu ab bunjiga maik. Gagu gyam wutu wo mani maniya se bot mai bo rwage na gyam eso.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Pa Yesu nyange na eb, &lt;&lt; mashinge, o zubchi tubaro na tube, o karige!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Kapaba bot bone bo rumigi, e zubuchi tubaro eshe tuhano to bob.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Oho irini e pare oho muget mo tandare ne. <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />Zwam nani, Yahudawa ange na bone bwaba rumigyatumi, &lt;&lt; ai, nare oho muget motandare ne, o shiu henda zhangi tubarna tobe ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />pa bone bo rumagi da bo chane yek bwangya, &lt;&lt; ai, bone bo na rumigya tumi, bob bwangya ezhangi tubaro natumi e karige&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />pa yek a kaba bone bu ka rumagi, &lt;&lt; Bot bwana bwange na gab o zhangi tubaro na tobe o karige?&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Bone bwaba rumigyatumi boik henda bo daki koga bo rumigi boik ba, zwam Yesu e rego e mashinge zwam udubu one oyo paba. <verse eid="JHN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Na Yesu onani Yesu e bangi ek na egenga nyange na bob, &lt;&lt; Hyanow, bo rumigeu! To, geshi turiya, zwam irine e hyange ete tuzuma e bu hi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />pa bot bote bo kore zwama Yahudawa, Yesu ena rumigyatumi ek. <verse eid="JHN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Zwamnani, Yahudawa arwage damaga Yesu, zwam eba e shagu iri ni e rumigyatumi oho muget mo tandare. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Yesu henda e chane yek nyangya &lt;&lt; Buchi nabumi bo on enk har nare, gyam ma ushiu dole nashi enk.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />zwamnani, Yahudawa a kisane gembo o yena o e hono Yesu, ba zwam e ba kachiya oho muget mo tandare suba ba, har ma zwam e be zwame nezwama onhon ushi buchi bo eb, wato, e raga kama gamaga na onhon.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iko e Bwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Pa Yesu e chane yek nyange, &lt;&lt; lelle tamahinda, bwa bo shagu ko nya bob boba ba, se ene e bob bo hya buchi bo onshi. Zwam kuchi ene e buchi bo ragashi, nani bwa bo onshi. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />zwam buch bo kudage bwa bunni, bo on henda chibaga bwa kuchio ene e buchi na reto rebob bo onshi, har ma buchi bwa chibano bwa enk ana a hyange ane, henda nyashi ya hyani. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Ta buchi bo raga anshigyatumi ana a owagi henda ayo na muhondo, nani henda bwa bwashingatoma bone bo kudage. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Buch bo shagiu koga udubu ba, se de bu ge konya bando bwa. <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />zwam koga bo pa bwa tuwaga, ta ba panga buchi tuwaga. Bone bo pagano bwa tuwaga ba, bo panga Buchi bone bo tuma bwa tuwaga ba. <verse eid="JHN 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />lelle tamahinda, na raga ke zwammagaa kuchi bone bwa hogo taaje numi, bo raga henda tanaga mahinda wo bone bo na tuma, bo zhe muhondo mo dududu, a shagiu boik hadoba ba, zwam bob bwarigo bwa koreu uʻu, bo wutago wo muhondo.<verse eid="JHN 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Lelle tamahinda, na raga ke kame zwama ga, gagu o on kore, har ushiu, na ana a owagi a hogo bigwaba be bwa bo onhon, ana a hogo henda anya na muhonda. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Ta Buchi nareto re bob bushi ripitu re muhondo, nani Bob bo tane bwa bushi ripitu re muhondo. <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />Buchi henda bo pa bwa iko e eshara hadoba, zwam bob bushi bwa bot. <verse eid="JHN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />Eta sha iye hyani o naniya, zwama gagu o on kore na kuchi ana ayo na so ha'uya a hogo bigwaba be bwa. <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />yek a sher henda, ato ana a shiu iyi bura̱ a mashinge, owashinga o muhondo, ana ashi ene e za e bura̱̱ a mashingeu, owashinga o hadoba.<verse eid="JHN 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hasheda a Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />&lt;&lt; Na pwashi komiba na iko nimi suba ba. Ta gyam on hoge, nani gyam on shaga hadoba, hadoba nami gyam on swabi ba, se ene e bone bona tuma bo kudage. <verse eid="JHN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />Na on sheda o reto narimi, sheda numi ushi o mahinda ba. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Azhe bone bwana shadu zagu, na daki henda sheda one o eb e raga kana shagyaga ushi mahinda. <verse eid="JHN 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />E tuma wo Yohana, Yohana henda e shedu mahinda. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Kuchi namini sheda one o gyam yinsa bando ob ushi o bot ba. Na zwame nani zwam e hi e chago. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Yohana ishi bechere bene bere, be tubanga henda, e yado henda ishi so chen dinya na tubanga to eb to gagu chimu. <verse eid="JHN 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />Ama sheda one o gyam zhe o hyange o Yohana mahonre. zwam enk ana a Buchi bona pa e hwagi, kuchi enk ana a gyam raga shaga, ai, ab ne shedanumi nezwama, buchi ne bona tuma. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Buchi henda bone bona tumi, bob na reto rebob bona shedu, etabo hoge bigwaba be bob ba, ko e hya e shunu bob ba. <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />E enu tutom to onhon na so nuhi ba zwam e tano mahinda wo bone bo ob o tuma ba. <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />E raga hirangaga hatakarda, zwam e onshi na she so nashihi pate gahi nya hi muhondo mo dududu, alhali ab on sheda numi. <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />Kuchi nanami, e wondo kore wo gyam e hi muhondo. <verse eid="JHN 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />&lt;&lt; Na on gembago tuwaga wo ato ba. <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />Ama name daki, eza tukudago to onhon na so nuhi. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Gyam na kore ne na reze re Buchi na bumi, gahya buna ena cheu ba. Shi bot mai bwa kore na reze re bob, bob gahi nya cheu. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />ingata gahi nyatana mahinda, gahi ana a gahi raga gembaga tuwaga wo hato nahi, tuwaga tune toyo bando onhon one oyo oba-oba henda, e on gembo tuba ba? <verse eid="JHN 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />E ta aza na meshibkeu hadoba wo Buchi. Azhe bone bwa me shibkeu hadoba, boba ne musa, bone bo gahi yinsa wo bob. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />kashi ta gahi yaje na Musa, kashi ka yado na gyam, zwam anabare nami Musa o herango. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Shi yado henda ne ene Musa o henange ba, inga ta gahya yado na taaje numiya?&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu e ryagasume A ta Dubu o ta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Nayena o nani, Yesu e kachiya hiro o rwaga oto o Galili, one ogage Tibariya. <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Udubu owato o swabi ek, zwam yek a hya iyahyani ane a Yesu e raga shagu ai rumigyatumegu e ana a rumagi. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Pa Yesu e hyane shama e shani warya taba na aswabo a bone eb. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Gagu o begenje be Yahudawa be kachiwa be shiu kusa. <verse eid="JHN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Yesu e dande reto e hya udubu o ato obe kore wo eb, pa Yesu e kaba Pilibus, &lt;&lt; Pa neu gatwahi kuryago ko gatwa sangya ato ani are?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Yesu e zwame nani zwam e mak pilibus, zwam eb Yesu e daki ta eb nyashi.<verse eid="JHN 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Pilibus e chane nyangye, &lt;&lt; Ko Kapuka ka dinare o bumi bura̱̱ ka sdama koga wo ab bo hi chimu ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />pa Andarawus buhuwa bo Bitrus ane ayo bando aswabo a bone Yesu, ange na Yesu, <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />&lt;&lt; Hingyana bwa a bona pani na kapuka ka ta ka sha'ir, na henda mukemba murya. Ama nya kuryago kuni kwashi na ato ani.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Yesu nyangye, &lt;&lt; E zwama ato a shanga.&gt;&gt; rihuga ne henda e hombe pa ato tware a shanga, ab dubu o ta. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />pa Yesu e zhangi kapuka kani, pa eb ishi egodu wo onhon henda, paba undugage ato ana shanga henda nani Yesu ishi na mukimpa muni, gwargwado ane e dama yek. <verse eid="JHN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Ta ato ani are a shigagi, pa Yesu nyangye na aswabo a bone eb, &lt;&lt; e zuranga kuchi ene e ryanta̱ bando erya, ko nya eta pu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />pa aswabo a bone eb a zuranga ene e ryanta̱ kuchi bando kapuka kani ka ta ka sha'ir ta koga bureu, pa aswabo ani a zuranga shinji na muryago mo kwape naryaryi. <verse eid="JHN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Ta ato a hya iyahyani ani a Yesu ishi, pa ab ange, &lt;&lt; Lelle, bone bushi butum bote bo on kore duniya!&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Na Yesu e dak yek a on kore a zhangi ek na mahonre ko na e kudago e eb ba a pa ek tugwama, pa Yesu e maringyaka zaat na shema eb eba.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ishi tuhana Na so mani ma rwaga oto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Na rembe ushi, pa aswabo a Yesu a kazhi rwaga oto. <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />Pa yek a esh o'ugu o mani a be nya esh hiro o rwaga oto koro ka parnahum. Na gagu uni tushi to shiu, Yesu henda e kureu wo ab ba katomo. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />pa rwaga o oto o rwage bigu zwam phar o mahonre one e raga huraga. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Yensa o ab rwago tuki o mil o tato ko o nashi, pa yek a hya Yesu e be sha tuhana na zaat mani e be kore kusa na o ugu. pa yek a wanrya. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Ana Yesu nyage naba, &lt;&lt; Gyamune e ta huga ryansa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Katomo yek a yaje a che Yesu na so ugu. ka paba pa yek a mahya na gab o ab koro.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Udubu o Gembage Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Na bungo o bunge udubu owato ana a yinsa ga na hiro o rwaga o oto a hya honzhe a za o ugu o mai Pateya, ka enakanaka emai yek a gano henda Yesu e eso na so uba taba na aswabo a bune eb ba, ka aswabo a bone Yesu ab ba ne a karige. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Azhe henda a mai a ugu a nuwa bando Tibariya ana a eso kusa pate pa udubu ore kapuka baya o Botʻbutuwaga bushi egwadu. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Gagu o udubu owato henda o hya Yesu ba, a hya aswabo a bone Yesu ba, ab ma a esago haʻugu a nuwa ani a karege Kaparnahum gembo o Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kapuka Ka E panga e Muhondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Ta ato ani a bangi Yesu na hiro o mai o rwaga o oto, ab ange na Yesu, &lt;&lt;Umarumi, oho owana gab kore pani?&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Yesu e chane, &lt;&lt; Na on kame zwammagaa mahinda: E on kana gembaga zwam ereu kapuka kate e shigagu, ba zwam gahi gano iyahyani nami ba. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Eta swa maduru bando kuryago kone kwa pwaso, se de kuryago kone kwa nya dududu, kone ko Bwa bot bwa me pa. zwam bob ne bo Onhon Buchi, o pa boik ala ai yado na bob.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />pa ato ani a kaba Yesu, &lt;&lt; Nya gatwashi zwam tushi ene e onhon o kudage gatushi?&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Yesu e chane yek, &lt;&lt; Ene e Onhon o kudage gahishi e bane gahi tane so na bone bo Onhon o tumane.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Pa ato ani a chane Yesu ange, &lt;&lt; Iri iyahyani ana a gabwa shi zwama gatu tane mahinda wo gab? nya gabwa shi? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />shikaka nashiti she reu manna na uzanga, ta shitak she zwame, &lt;&lt; Musa o pa yek kapuka wari na turwana yekare&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Katumo Yesu nyange naba, na on kame zwammagaa mahinda, rene e musa o me pa ba kapuka ba kane kasher wari na turwana ba, ai Buchi nabumi ne boi pa kuryago ko mahinda kate wari na turwana <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Ai, kapuka ka Onhon kabane kane ka on kazhagi wari na turwana kapa ato duniya mohondo mo dududu.<verse eid="JHN 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Pa ato ani a kaba Yesu ange, &lt;&lt; Butuwaga, o raga katu panga iri kuni kuryago ko hwane!&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Pa Yesu nyange naba, &lt;&lt; Gyamshi kapuka ka e panga e muhondo mo dududu, kuchi ana a korago wo gyam a hogaka remyaro ba, ana a yado na gyam henda a hogaka tu'oware to mani ba dududu. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Na mai zwama henda, e na hya, kuchi nanani e tano so ba. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Kuchi bone bo Buchi bona pa a kore wo gyam, bone henda bo kore wo gyam na uzangu boik ba ko chimu. <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />Zwam na kazhiya wariya na turwana ba zwam na swabe nupi numi ba, se de nupi o Onhon Buchi bone bona tuma wari na turwan. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Ene e be shi nupi o bone bona tuma henda, eta nagi koga boink bando ana a bob bona pa, se de nashingatum yek oho akundaga o hadoba. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Zwam une obushi nupi Buchi nabumi, kuchi bone bo hya bwa, henda bo tano so wo bob bo hi muhondo mo dududu. henda na anshiga yek na muhondo oho akundaga.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Pa Yahudawa a shagi Yesu kamawuhingura, zwam Yesu nyange, &lt;&lt; Gyamshi kapuka kane ka sher wari na turwana.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Pa Yahudawa ange, &lt;&lt; Ashe, bone bushi Yesu now, bwa bo Yusupu, bone bo Buchi na yini eb tu daki yek kuchi. To inga ta eb nyazwame eba e sher wari na turwana?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Yesu e chane yek nyange, &lt;&lt; Etama sha kamawungura. <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Aza ato ane a kore wo gyamu se de Buchi na bumi bone bona tuma bo numi boik wo gyam henda, henda na mashingeu yek na muhondo oho akundaga. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Oyo herange na shitak she a tuma nezwama &lt; Kuchi owaba Onhon ne owachibaga yek? To kuchi bone bo hoge, henda bo koyi wo Buchi, bwa kore wo gyam. <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Ba nezwama azhe bone bo taba hya Buchi buni, se de Yesu ene e sher bando Onhon, bob ne bo taba hya Buchi. <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />Lelle mahinda na on kame zwammagaa, bone bo tano so bando numi Yesu, boyo na muhondo mo dududu. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Gyamshi kuryago ko muhondo mo dududu. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Shikaka nashikaka nashihi she reu manna na ozanga, ama yeka owagu. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Ama kapuka kane ka sher wari na turwana bone kuchi bo reu bwa owagaka ba. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Gyamshi kapuka ka muhondo mo dududu kane ka kazhiya wari na turwana ko ga bone bo reu kapuka kani, bwa nya na muhondo dududu har kapuka kani ka gyamwa tuta monego mo kingi na kami ne, zwam ato duniya, o nya na muhondo.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 6:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Pa Yahudawa ashingya muhatasu mo mahonre bando ab ba, a be zwammagaa, &lt;&lt; Inga ta bot bote bwa tupa monego mo kingi ka bob gatu re?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Pa Yesu nyange naba, &lt;&lt; Lelle tamahinda na on kame zwammagaa, shi reu monego mo kingi ka bwa bot ba, gahi henda esu mahi ma bob ba, nyahi muhondo na so nuhi ba. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Kuchi ana a reu monego mo kingi nakami a su mahi na mami henda a hiu muhondo mo dududu, henda na mashinge yek na muhondo mo dududu oho akundaga. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Zwam monego namumi mushi kuryago ko mahinda mahi na mami henda iya swa e mahinda. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Kuchi ana a reu monego mo kingi na kami henda asu mahi namami, ayo na so numi gyam henda na yo sowaba. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Ta Buchi bo muhondo bona tuma, zwam bob gyam yo na muhondo kumba, nani henda kuchi bone bona reu munego na mumi bwa nya na muhondo zwam gyam. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Gyamshi kuryago kone ko kazhi wari na turwana kushi ko mahinda, ko yo ta kane ka shikaka nashihi she re ba. Yekareu ama a owagu, ama kuchi bone bo reu kane ka sher wari na turwana bwa nya na muhondo mo dududu.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 6:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Yesu e zwam taaje uni kuchi gagu eb e on chibaga na rihuga re menga na kaparnahum.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hera ene e Panga Muhondo Mo Dududu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Na aswabo a Yesu dinya a hoge echibaga ini e Yesu e on chibaga, ange, &lt;&lt;Echibaga eni ezhe mahonre. Ga bwo pwa che ek?&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 6:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Yesu henda e daki nezwama aswabo a eb yink a on kamawungura na she so shaba zwam echibaga e eb pa eb nyange naba, &lt;&lt; Wato,echibaga ini e sa gahishi ehogo e tudau? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Inga Taabashi shi hya Bwa bot babe hyana wo bob bu ka yo? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Ai, uhunchi ushi iyi muhondo, mahonre ma kingi kam ka pwashi shi ko nya ba, here te e gyame zwama e sher bando uhunchi Onhon one o panga henda muhondo. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Ama har yanzu azhe henda ato a mai wo gahi ana atano so ba&gt;&gt; Zwam etano so, na henda bone bwa tuta ek. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Pa Yesu e kisane nezwama, &lt;&lt; obosa gyame zwama, aza bone bwapwa kore wo gyamu, se ko Buchi bo yaduwa boik.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Zwam uni aswabo a bone eb a maringeu yesa, a shagyaka tuhano na Yesu ba paba maringe giu. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Pa Yesu e zwame na ato rikwape na ryari, &lt;&lt; Gahi ma e kudage e karege ena geya. <verse eid="JHN 6:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Bitrus be chane Yesu byange, &lt;&lt; Wo ga gatwa koro? Gab zhe hera ene e panga muhondo mo dududu <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Gatu henda to tano so, to yado henda nezwama gab shi bot bone bo za turiya bo Onhon.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Pa Yesu e chane yek nyange, &lt;&lt; Ba gyame yinga gahi ato kwape na haryagya ba? To, boink bando nuhi bushi Ibilish.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Wato, Yesu e on na Yahuza, bwa bo saminu Iskariyoti, zwam eb ne nya tuta Yesu, ko na ob ushi eyo bando ato rekwape na haryagya ane.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu Na Shihuwa She Eb.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Yesa o nani, Yesu e raga ringichaga na tonge to Galili, e yado e ringichiya bando o tonge to Yahuda ba, zwam Yahudawa a kudage a hone ek. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Begenje be bukoki be Yahudawa henda be nya kore. <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />pa ahuwa a Yesu ange na eb, mashinge pani nai o kore tonge to Yahudiya, aswabo a bune nebe ma a hya enk a iyahyani a gab on shi. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Ai, aza bone bwashi enk swenya shi bukudage a daki enk a boba, shi bo on iri enk ani, to, se oma chibane wo ato duniya a bu daki&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Zwam ko ahuwa Yesu ma a yado na eb ba.<verse eid="JHN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Pa Yesu chen yek, gagu numi o shiu ba katomo, ama gahi ko hwane gagu nuhi ne. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Oza dama ato duniya o mai wunje, ama gyam ab on wonje, zwam na zwama enk ato duniya ashi a mugu. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Gahi de e kore begenje bini. Gyamwa koro yanzu ba, zwam gagu numi ushiu ba katomo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Na Yesu e zwama yek nani, pa eb e zhikitagi na tonge to Galili.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wo Begenje Be Bukoki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Na shihuwa she Yesu a karige begenje beni henda, pa Yesu e kore, swenya, ama ba sabchiya ba. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Ato tuwaga a Yahudawa ab ke yingyaga ek wo begenje bini a be zwammagaa, &lt;&lt; Yesu e yo pa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Udubu uni oraga shaga tage o Yesu swenya, ato mai a be zwammagaa, &lt;&lt; Yesu ishi bot bura̱.&gt;&gt; Ato mai henda a be zwammagaa, &lt;&lt; A'a, ai, Yesu e raga pwatumaga ato.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Ama aza bone bo shiu taaje o Yesu sabchiya zwam ryansa re a tuwaga a Yahudawa.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Ab na so begenje ba un pa Yesu e esh rihuga re menga e be chibaga. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Yahudawa ashi iyahyani a irini, ab ange &lt;&lt; Inga ta bot bote buzhe eherangago nani, hingyana henda, etabo koya ba?&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Pa Yesu nyange naba, &lt;&lt; E chibagano nimi e shere wo bone bona tuma. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Kuchi bone bo kudage bushi ene e onhon o kudage bwa daku ne zwama ene e gyam on chibaga e sher bando onhon ko henda na on chibaga na mahonre na mami. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Kuchi bone bo on, chibaga na mahonre ma bob, bukudage bo hi e dan edanduwa e reto rebob wo ato. Ama bone bo on gembo e dan edanduwa e bone bo tuma boik, bushi bot bo mahinda, aza henda nagu o mahinda wo boba. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Ba Musa o me pa esapo e Onhon ba? kuchi nanani aza bot bone bo on getaga aika bando nuhi. zwam nya gahi on gembo o kana hono?&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Udubu owato o chane Yesu, &lt;&lt; Bo yo na upher shir, ga bwa bo hono gab?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Yesu e chane udubu owato nyange, &lt;&lt; Nashiu iyahyani ink, pa gahishi iyahyani. <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Musa owange na gahi e shagi awo nahi kachiya, kona obushi o Musa ba tun na shikaka nashihi oyo nani, nani gahi shagi awo nahi a tware kachiya taba na oho mugeta mo tandare. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Shi a shagiu bwa bo tware kachiya oho mugeta mo tandare zwam a ta hada hadoba a Musa, zwam nya gahi on hoge so shir na gyam zwam na rumugiu bot bote kuchi oho mugeta mo tandare? <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Eta shera hadoba na e hya e risha ama na mahinda&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Ishi Botʻbwakimga?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Pa ato ink na urushalema ange, &lt;&lt; Ashe, ba bot buni bushi bot bo ato tuwaga a Yahudawa a on yingyaga a hone boik ba? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Hingyana! Eragash taaje sabchiya, a zwamo na Yesu konyaba! Owashi henda ato tuwaga a Yahudawa a dagi nezwama bot bone bushi Botʻbwakimga? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Bot buni kam, tudaki bando bob bo sher, ama gagu o Botʻbwakimga bo mahinda bwa koro, aza bone bwa daku wo bob bo shere ba.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Ta Yesu e zwam na rihuga re menga, e dande begwabo nyange, &lt;&lt; Ena daki gyam, e daki henda wo gyam yo? Na kurwa na mahonre na mami ba. Buchi bone bo natuma henda bushi bot bwa yajiya. E daki boik ba, <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />Ama gyam daki boik, zwam na sher bando bob, bob ne henda bone bo na tuma.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Na Yesu e hwagi zwammagaa iri ni, pa ato tuwaga a Yahudawa a kudage a huma Yesu, ama aza bone bo da̱ru ek ko bukombe ek ba, zwam gagu o eb ushiu ba katomo. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Ama kuchi nanani bando udubu uni azhe ato dinya ana a tane so na Yesu, a be zwammagaa, &lt;&lt; Gagu Botʻbwakimga bwa kore, bwashi iyahyani hyange na bot buni?&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A tuma Hadogari A Huma Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Na parisiyaw a hoge udubu owato a be shi kamawungura zwam Yesu nani, pa ato tuwaga a Pristochi na Parisiyawa a tuma hadogari a huma Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Pa Yesu nyange naba, &lt;&lt; Gagu chimu o sa yo gatu na gahi, katomo e maringe bando bone bo na tuma. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Nyema yingyaga, ama nyana hyaba, zwa e pwa koro wo gyam yo ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Pa a tuwaga a Yahudawa ama zwama,&lt;&lt;Pa eb nya kore wo gatwa pwa hi ek ba? Yesu nya kore pa tonge to Hiliniyawa pane pa ato nati Yahudawa a be chibaga yek? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Nya Yesu e on ne zwamo ene &lt;Nya o mungewa namumi ama nyana hyanaka ba, pa gyam yo henda e pwa kore ba?<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hajaba a Mani Ma Muhondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Ab namani, oho o akundaga o Begenje, wato, oho a tuwaga o beganje, pa Yesu e mashinge yesane, e dande begwabo dinya nyamge,&lt;&lt;Kuchi bone bo on hoge tu'oware to mani bo kore bo su. <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />Kuchi bone bo tane so na gyam, ta nasi owange,&lt;Bando Yesu ne hajaba a mani ma muhondo ma shiryage.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Yesu e zwame nani bando uhunchi, one o ana atane so bando e a cheu, zwam har nare a pano uhunchi ba katomo zwam a pa Yesu eshindu e dan edanduwa eb ba katomo.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kama undagaga o eso Bando Ato.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Ato yink Taaba hoge taaje uni bando udubu pa ab ange, &lt;&lt;Tamahinda bone buashi butuma bote bo Onhon!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Ato mai henda ange, &lt;&lt;Bone bushi Botʻbwakimga!&gt;&gt;.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:41">Ama ato mai henda ange, &lt;&lt; Botʻbwakimga bwa kore wari na tonge to Galili! <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Ba Nasi owange Botʻbwakimga bushi ibenchi e Dauda ba, shi'undu she Dauda o shani&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Pa kama undagaga o mashinge bando ato na reto re Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Ato yinka a kudago a huma Yesu, ama aza bone bo da̱ru ek.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ato tuwaga a parisiyawa A yado Na Yesu Ba.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Na ato e gitago a maringe wo ato tuwaga a pristochi na pariyawa pa yeka kaba ato e getago ane ab tuma, nezwama,&lt;&lt;Zwamanya gahi koro na Yesu ba?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Pa ato e getago a chane ange,&lt;&lt;Aza bone bo pwashi taaje ta bot buriya!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Pa ato tuwaga apristochi na pasiyawa ange,&lt;&lt;Ap, eme wariyasumu gahi kumba? <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />Ashe, azhe bot bando a tuwaga ko pariyawa bone bo tano so na Yesu? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Ama udubu uni o dakiwa̱ hadoba a musa, ai, yeka yo na yinu yo wo Onhon!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Nikodimu henda ene e yo taba na Yesu eyo na so waba henda, nyange naba, <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />&lt;&lt;Ashe, hadoba nati a raga paraga buto tun a hogo na yinu bob ba, a daku henda ene bob bushi ba?&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 7:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Pa parisiyawa na a tuwaga a chane Nikodamu nezwama, &lt;&lt;Gab ma bushi Bagalile, hirangya shitak she Onhon bwahya̱ nezwama aza butuma bumaya bone bwa shire na Galili.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 7:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />Pa koga bo maringe yaba bob.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s1">Bwaa Bwaba Bangi na Tugari.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Kapaba ko ga bo karige giu, ama Yesu e hyane shama e eʻo e zaitun. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Na bungonge henda Yesu e esaka Egenga. Kuchi ato a kore wo eb, pa e shani e be chibaga yek. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Pa hamarumi a chibagano e hadoba a Musa na Parisiyawa a shibkane Yesu bwaa bone bwaba kumbe na tugari. Paba yinse boik na so owato kuchi. <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />Pa Parisiyawa na hamarumi a echibaga e Musa ange na Yesu, &lt;&lt; Umarumi, bwaa buni a kumbe boik bobeshi tugari. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />To, na so hadoba a Musa a herago nezwama a tagage iri bot bote har bu'u, gab henda yanzu nya gabwa zwame?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Yeka zwame nani ne zwam yek maka Yesu, ko yeka hi yeno o e shibkane ek wo aduba. Ama Yesu e kazhi reto, ebe shi ehenrago na tonge na e bob e eb.<verse eid="JHN 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Ta ba kumbe kabaga Yesu pa eb emashenge yesane nyange, &lt;&lt;To, bone boza turiya bo rwage taga bwaa boni nate.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Pa Yesu e kisane kazhi reto re eb, eb ke ehenrangaga na tong. <verse eid="JHN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Ab henda taba hoge nani a kumbe sheraga boink-boink, bando ato ab mugyare na ato now ba, ab ge Yesu eb eba, na bwaa yesane pate. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Pa Yesu e mabanbege e kaba bwaa buni, &lt;&lt; Bwaa bo yaba, yek ayo pa? Aza bone bo yesa bo bu shereu hadoba?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Bwaa boni bwange, &lt;&lt; Gab butuwaga aza.&gt;&gt;.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:11">Pa Yesu nyange, &lt;&lt; Oyo honzhe, gyam ma nabo shereu hadoba ba. sha tuhano na tobe wari nare ota shaka turiya ba.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Ishi Tubanga To Duniya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Pa Yesu e kisana yek nezwama, &lt;&lt; Gyamshi tubanga to duniya. Bone bo on kana swabe bwashi tuhano na so tushi ba, ama bwa hi tubanga to ne to panga muhondo mo dududu.<verse eid="JHN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Pa Parisiyawa ange na Yesu, &lt;&lt; Reto narebe gab on kanashagya taaje, taaje na obe o gab kana shagyaga ushi o mahinda ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Pa Yesu e chane Pariyawa nyange, &lt;&lt; Ko na mashagi taaje o reto rinimi, ai, taaje numi ushi mahinda zwam na daki wo gyamsher, na henda wo gyamwa koro. Ama gahi daki wo gyamsher ba na henda wo gyamwa koro ba. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Gahi on sheranga hadoba ta ato duniya a raga shaga bando tusongo to yinu, gyam henda na sherangiwa ko ga hadoba. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Ama ko nasherya hadoba henda, eshereu hadoba nami ashi a mahinda, zwam gyam yo gyamgyamu ba, zwam Buchi bone bo mu tuma bo yo taba na gyamu. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Na so hadoba a Musa nahi oyo herange nezwama, ezwamo e ato barya̠gya̠ ushi owa yajiya. <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Gyam on kana zwammagaa reto rinimi, Buchi bone bona tuma henda bo on taaje na reto rinimi. <verse eid="JHN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Zwamnani Parisiyawa ani ange na Yesu, &lt;&lt; Buchi buni na bobe boyo pa?&gt;&gt; Pa Yesu e chane nyange nabba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:19">&lt;&lt; Ko gyam ko Buchi nabumi aza bone bo gahi daki shi na daki gyam ena daku Buchi nabumi ba un.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Yesu ezwame uni kuchi na so Yaba e Onhon e menga pani paba iragi hazonga a e panga uhanchi gagu eb ishi e chibagano pani, ama kuchi nanani aza bone bo huma ek, zwam gagu o Yesu ushiu ba katomo.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">E pwa koro wo Gyamwa koro Ba.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Pa Yesu e kisane zwama Yahudawa &lt;&lt; Nashi tuhano, nyana yingyaga ama nya u na turiya na tuhi&gt;. Wo gyamwa koro henda e pwa koro ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Zwamnani pa ato tuwaga a Yahudawa ange, &lt;&lt; Wato nya mahono ba unu na eb nyange &lt; wo gyamwa koro e pwa koro ba?&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Pa Yesu nyange naba, &lt;&lt; Gahishi ato tonge, gyamshi bot bo turwana. Gahi shi ato duniya uni, ama gyamushi henda bot bo duniya uni ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Obo sa gyamwange na gahi nya u na turiya na tuhi shi tanoso nezwama gyamshi bone bo gyam on zwammagaa gyamshi ba, a me yapeu turiya natuhi ba.&gt;&gt;. <verse eid="JHN 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Pa Yahudawa ange na Yesu, &lt;&lt; Gab shi ga?&gt;&gt;.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:25">Pa Yesu nyange naba, &lt;&lt; Nayo ta gyame zwama na Jigu. <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Azhe iyi dinya ene e gyamwa zwamo na reto na rihi, ene gyamwa me shere hadoba henda. Ama bone bona tuma bushi bot bo mahinda, Ene e gyam hoge bando bob henda eba e gyam raga zwammagaa ato duniya.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Yahudawa a gano nezwama Yesu e on shagi yek taaje o Buchi ba. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Pa Yesu nyange naba, &lt;&lt; Gagu o gahi dande bwa bot, gagu uni ne gahya gano gyamshi bone bo gyame zwama gyamshi bob, na shagu henda konya gyamu-gyamu ba, se Buch na bumi buna zwama katomo, nani henda gyamwa zwamo. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Bone henda bona tuma bo yo taba na gyamu, bona geu gyamu-gyamu ba, zwam kohwane na raga shagu ene bob bo kudage.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Na Yesu e zwame irini kuchi, ato ana a bake ek dinya a tane so na eb.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Agyam Na ane Aza Agyam.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Pa Yesu nyange na Yahudawa ane a yaje na eb, &lt;&lt; Shi de e on shaga ene e gyame zwama, gahishi aswabo a bone nimi a mahinda. <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />Nya daki mahinda, mahinda henda ma me chago.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Yek ange na Yesu, &lt;&lt; Ai, gatushi ebenchi e Ibrahim, to tabo shagya koga tugyama ba, inga ta gabwa zwame atu chago henda?&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Pa Yesu e chane yek nyange, &lt;&lt; Lelle tamahinda, na raga ke zwammagaa, kuchi bone bo on shagu turiya bushi bugyam bo turiya ba un. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Ai, bugyam bo shanga bando o yaba dududu ba, ama bwa henda bwa shanga na yaba dududu. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Shi henda bwa buni bo me paso, e paso ba un, e paso e mahinda. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Na daki de nezwama gahishi ibenchi e Ibrahim, ama henda e on gembo o kana hono, zwam e yado na taaje numi ba. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Na on zwammagaa ene e gyam hoge wo Buchi na bumi, gahi henda e on zwammagaa ene e gahi hoge wo buchi na buhi.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bugwam Bo Muphar Bushi Buchi Na Buhi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Yahudawa a chane Yesu ange, &lt;&lt; Ai, Ibrahim ishi buchi na buti.&gt;&gt;.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:39">Yesu chane yek, &lt;&lt; Shi gahishi awo a Ibrahim, shi ka shiu enk ana a Ibrahim ishi. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Hingyana yanzu, e on gembo o kana hono, gyam bone bo gyame zwama mahinda mane ma gyam hoge wo Onhon Buchi na bumi. Ibrahim e shiu konya nani ba! <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Ama gahi raga shaga ene e buchi na buhi bo on shaga.&gt;&gt; Pa yek ange na Yesu, &lt;&lt; Buchi na buti bo gatuzhe Onhon oba uba, henda gatushi awo a ob a mahinda&gt;&gt;. <verse eid="JHN 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Pa Yesu nyage naba, &lt;&lt; Sheka zwame Onhon ushi Buchi na buhi bo mahinda sheka kudago gyam, zwam na sher wari wo Onhon, gyamwa buna henda, na kurwa zwam reto rinimi ba Onhon ob o na tuma. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Zwam nya gahi dakiwa̱ taaje numi? zwam e pwa kama ibga e hoge taaje numi ba. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Gahishi a buchi na buhi bugwam bo muphar, e raga henda shagu ene e bob bo kudage. Bob henda tun da bushi bot boi honago e ato na arigi henda, aza ene ishi mahinda bando boba. bo raga shaga taaje one o bob bo kudage, ko nya henda e bob bo zwame ishi arigi. ba ma bushi bwarigi suba ba, henda bushi buchi bo ana a shagu arigi. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Ama naraga ke zwammagaa mahinda, obo sa gahi tano so na gyamu ba. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Na so nuhi ga bwa zwame nezwama nataboshi turiya? Shi henda mahinda gyam raga zwammagaa, to, zwam nya gahi tano so na gyam ba? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Kuchi bone bushi bo Onhon bo raga hogaga tutom tone to sher wo Onhon. ama ane a sher wo Onhon ba a hugago taaje one o sher wo Onhon ba &gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Na Ibrahim.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Ato Yahudawa a chane Yesu ange, &lt;&lt; Ashe, mahinda na mati na gatu ange na gab bushi bot bo tonge to samariye, bo yo henda na muphar mowo.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Yesu e chane nyange, &lt;&lt; Gyam yo na muphar mowo ba. Buchi na bumi gyam on dandaga, ama gahi henda e raga kana kazhaga. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Ba reto narimi gyam on yingyaga e dan edanduwa ba, ama azhe bone bo on kana yingyaga e dan edanduwa, boba ne henda bo e shagu hadoba. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Lelle tamahinda gyam on kame zwammagaa, ko ga bo swabo taaje numi, bwa u ba dududu&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Pa Yahudawa ange na Yesu, &lt;&lt; To, nare kam, to yado boyo na muphar mowo. Ai, Ibrahim e u, nani ma a tuma. Inga ta gabwa zwamo ezwama kuchi bone bo yado na taaje nobe bwa u ba. <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Buchi na buti Ibrahim e u, gab henge Ibrahim? A tuma henda a u. gab shi ga bune bwa u ba.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Pa Yesu e chane nyange, &lt;&lt; Shi henda na dande reto rinimi, e dan edanduwa nimi e yo na yinu ko nyaba. Buchi na bumi bushi bone bona dande, bone bo gahi raga zwammagaa, bushi Onhon nuhi. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Ko na gahi daki boik ba, ama gyam daki boik, shi kana zwame na daki boik ba shina shiu bot bo tak ta gahi. Ama na daki boik, na on henda shaga ene e bob bo zwame. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Buchi nabuhi Ibrahim ishiu ma koda e hya koro numi, e hya henda, e sheu makuda.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 8:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Pa Yahudawa ange na Yesu, &lt;&lt; Har nare ma bo korowa hashekara akwape ta, inga ta gabwa zwame bo daki Ibrahim?&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 8:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Pa Yesu nyange naba, &lt;&lt; Tamahinda na raga ke zwammagaa, kame a machie Ibrahim eyo, gyam yo pa.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 8:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Zwamnani pa Yahudawa a hyangi te zwam a tagage Yesu. Yesu henda e ma swe, pa eb e sher na so yaba e Onhon.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu E Rumigi Bot Bone Bwaba Mache Buruba.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Yesu ebe shi tuhano pa eb e bangi bot bone bwaba machie boik buruba. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Pa Aswabo a bune Yesu a kaba Yesu ange, &lt;&lt; Umarumi, &lt;&lt; Ga bushi turiya tone to sa amachiya bot bote buruba, boba unbu henda hacheche?&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Yesu e chane yek nyange, &lt;&lt; Ba zwam bot buni bushi turiya ko hacheche ba, se zwam a chibane mahonre ma enk a onhon na reto rebob. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Tu hena shaga enk tun na onhwaho osa yowa, Ai, ageta a raga kore gagu o koga bo pwashi enk ba. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Shi henda na yo na duniya gyamushi tubanga to duniya.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Na Yesu e zwame nani pa eb e tupangi hatambi na tonge, e hotara na tonge, pa Yesu e sukuta na yisha e buruba buni, <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />Yesu nyange na buruba, &lt;&lt; Karigya, o shitagi shinu nebe na mani ma siluwam,&gt;&gt; Wato bone bwaba tuma. Kapaba bob bo karige bo shitagi yisha bob kapaba bob bo maringe yaba bobe hyanaga.<verse eid="JHN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Ato magenda na ato ana a raga hyanaga boik bobeshi roko, awzame &lt;&lt; Ashe, ba bot bunii bone bo raga shaga roko a bone ba?&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Ato mai henda ange, &lt;&lt; Boba ne.&gt;&gt; Ato mai henda ange, &lt;&lt; A'a, ab de a shiu shinu yinka.&gt;&gt; Buruba henda bwange tamahinda gyam ne.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Zwamnani pa ato ani ange na buruba bunio , &lt;&lt; Inga Taabashi yisha nabe a raga hyanaga?&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Buruba buni bo chane, &lt;&lt; Bot bote bone bwaba ogage Yesu bo hutara tonge na hatambi bona sukuta na yisha nami, bwange, &lt; Karige mani ma siluwam o guzagi,&gt; Kapaba na gyam guzagi shinu nimi pa gyam hi e hyanagu &gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Pa ato ani ange &lt;&lt; Eyo pa?&gt;&gt; Buruba bwange, &lt;&lt; Na daki ba.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Parisiyawa a kudage a hi Ta Erumigeu Ene E Rwage.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Pa ato ani a zhangi buruba buni na Jigu wo parisiyawa. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />To oho mugeta motandare ne Yesu e hutara tonge tuni e rumige boik. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Pa parisiyawa a kabaka boik ta bob bo hi e hyanagu. Bwange naba, &lt;&lt; Tonge to Yesu e hutara ena sukuta na yisha nami, na guza, na kumbe hyanagu.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Ato yinka bando parisiyawa ani ange, &lt;&lt; Bot bote bo sher bando onhon ba zwam bo geto oho mogeta mo tandare ba.&gt;&gt; Ato mai henda ange, &lt;&lt; Inga ta bone bozhe turiya bwashi enk a iya hyani naniya? pa kama undagago o mashingeu bando o parisiyawa.<verse eid="JHN 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Pa parisiyawa ani a kisane zwama na bone bu na shi buruba, &lt;&lt; To, gab now, nya gab hya wo boba, zwam gab ne bob bo burumigi?&gt;&gt; Bone bu na shi buruba bwange, &lt;&lt; Ai, bushi butum bo Onhon.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Ama Yahudawa a yado ne zwama bushi buruba da ba, bo hi e hyanagu, shi ab ogage hacheche a bob, <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />a kaba yek ange, &lt;&lt; Bone bushi bwa nabuhi bone bo gahi ogaga amachiya boik buruba? To inga ta bob bo pwa hyanaga nare?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Pa hacheche a bob a chane ne zwama, &lt;&lt; Gatu de tudaki nezwama bwa buni bushi bwa nabuti, henda amachiya boik buruba. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Ama tabashi bobe hyana nare tu daki ba, tudaki ma bone bo sabchi boik yisha ba. E kaba boik, ai bushi bwa bo nuwa ba nya zwame na yinu bob.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Hacheche a boba a zwame nanine zwama ryansa re atuwa Yahudawa, zwama da ma Yahudawa a para nezwama kuchi bone bo zwamo ne zwama, bone burumigi boik bushi Botʻbwakimga, a shiryatume boik bando rihuga rekamahara e Yahudawa. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />obo sa hacheche a bob ange, &lt;&lt; Ai, ishi bwa ba, e kaba boik.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Pa yek kisane ogage bot bone bushi buruba da, ab ange na bob, &lt;&lt; O hoge ryansa re onhon! Gatu de tudaki bot bone bushi bot bo turiya.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Bone bu na shi buruba bwange naba, &lt;&lt; Ko bushi bot bo turiya gyam daki ba. iyi ink de e gyam daki, da gyamshi buruba nare henda naraga hyanaga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Pa ab ange na bob, &lt;&lt; Shin, nya eb e bo shagi? Inga ta bob bo sabchiya yisha nabe?&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Bone bushi buruba da bo chane yek bwange, &lt;&lt; Na raga ke kezwamagaa, e hogo ba. zwam nya gahi kudage e hugaka? Ko gahi ma e kudage ishi aswabo a bone eba?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Pa a tuwaga a Yahudawa a hina zwagage boik zuma, a be zwammagaa, &lt;&lt; Gab shi de buswabo bo bone eb, ama gatu de tushi aswabo a bune Musa. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Gatu de tu daki Onhon o shiu taaje na musa, ama buni tudaki ko pa bob bo sher ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Pa bone bushi buruba da, bo chane yek bwange, &lt;&lt; Iyahyani binu nare! Ashe e daki wo bob bo shere ba, ba ena henda ena sabchiu yisha nami! <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Tu daki Onhon o hogagiwa ato turiya, ama kuchi bone bo on gyamata Onhon, bo raga henda shaga ene e Onhon o kudage, Onhon o hugago boik. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Tun tabashi duniya a tabo hoge bone bo sabchiu yisha a bone bwaba machie buruba ba. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Shi bot buni bo sher bando Onhon ba, shi a ka za ene bob bo pwashi naniya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Pa a tuwaga a Yahudawa ani a chane boik ange, &lt;&lt; Gab bone bwaba machie na so turiya busiu tuwaga na so turiya gabwa tu chibaga?&gt;&gt; Pa yeka uzanga boik.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Buruba Bo Uhunchi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Na Yesu e hoge Yahudawa a urizagu bot bone bo eb e rumigi na so rihuga rekamahara e Yahudawa, na eb e bangi boik nyange &lt;&lt; Bo tano mahinda na gyamu Bwa buto?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Pa bob bo chane bwange, &lt;&lt; Umarumi, nazwama ko ga ne bwa bot bushi, zwam gyam yaje na bob?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Yesu nyange na bob, &lt;&lt; Ai, bo hya boik bob ne bo on taaje na gab yanzu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Bone bo nashi buruba bwange, &lt;&lt; Gab Umarumi, na tanimamahinda.&gt;&gt; Bo hina bo shagi Yesu henda tugyama. <verse eid="JHN 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Yesu nyange &lt;&lt; Na eshe duniya uni zwam e ondagago, zwam ana a hyanagiwa a hya, ana a hyanagi henda a shi ruba. <verse eid="JHN 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Na parisiyawa ani ana ayo taba na bot buniya a hoge nani, ange na bob, &lt;&lt; Wato gatushi aruba ba unu?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Yesu nyange naba, &lt;&lt; Ai, shi kashi aruba, ekaza turiya. Ama shi gahi zwame e hyanagi, to, nani ushi nezwama turiya na tuhi tusayo.<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s1">Egagau E Buhuba Bo Tami.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />Yesu nyange Lelle tamahinda na on kame zwammagaa, bone bo eso Bangu o tame bando o yinu eso ba,ama bo swabe yeno mai, to bot bote bushi buhi henda bone bo chago na mahonre, <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Bone bo eso bando yinu eso bushi buhuba bo tami ni. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Bone bo on getaga yinu eso henda bo raga sabchigyaga boik, tami ni henda erega bakiya bigwaba be bob, bo raga humaga reze re ko byana bitami bo shiryatume yek hasa. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Yesa bob bo shiryatume ene ishi e bob kuchi, katomo bo re tusha to tamini e bob tami ni eragaga boik zwam tami ni e hogage henda e daki bigwaba be buhuba. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Tami ni nya swabo bot bo kanyaba, se de e some boik, zwam e daki bigwaba be bot bo kanya ba. <verse eid="JHN 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Yesu e shagi yek ini e gagau, ama yek a gano konya eb ezwama yek ba.<verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Ishi Buhuba Bo Bura̱̱</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Zwam nani Yesu e kisane zwama yek &lt;&lt;Lelle tamahinda naraga ke zwammagaa, gyamshi yinu eso e tamini. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Kuchi ana a sugi gyam koro nezwama ab shi gyam, ashi Hahi ana a chago na mahonre henda, ama tami nya madamo na yek ba. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Gyam shi yinu eso koga bo eso bando numi bwa hi e chago bo shebke henda bo maringe bushi henda rihuba. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Buhi henda bo kurya zwam bushi buhi bo hone bot, na e pwatumagu ama gyam kore zwam yek Hahi muhondo, bo hi moik henda dududu. <verse eid="JHN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />Yesu nyange, gyamshi buhuba bo bura̱̱. Buhuba bo bura̱̱ henda bob ne bo panga muhondo mo bob zwam tami bob. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Bone bushi dan asako henda bushi buhuba bo bura̱̱ ba, tamini ishi e bob ba, na e hya e kerkechi e be kore, se bo ge tamini, bo karige, kerkechi henda e swabe emai e kome henda emai e enage. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Bo some zwam bob bushi dan,asako, aza ene e damaga boik na tami niya. <verse eid="JHN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />Gyamshi buhuba bo bura̱̱ Na daki nami, nami henda ana daki, <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />Ta Buchi bona daki gyam, gyam henda na daki Buchi. Na on panga muhondo na mumi zwam tami niya. <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Na zhe henda tami mai ene shi e bangu uniya ba. Eba ma tamahinda se e zhangi yek, tami ni nya na bake bigwaba na bimi, ashi bangu oinka̱, buhuba henda boink. <verse eid="JHN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />Zwam nani Buchi bona kudage, zwam naraga panga muhondo na mumi e zhagi moik henda. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Aza bone bwa pwa che muhondo na mumi, zwam gyam kudage ke pa moik. Na zhe iko e panga e mohondo na mumi, na zhe iko e zhangu e mob henda, Na che ene esapo na wa Buchi nabumi&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Zwam taaje uni, pa kama undagaga o mashingyaka bando o Yahudawa. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Ato dinya bando ato Yahudawa ange, Ai, Eyo na muphar mowo, bigu be eb suba e be e ragashi, zwam nya gahi on bake ek?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />A mai henda ange,&lt;&lt;A'a, taaje uni ai, ushi o bot bo muphar ba. Ashe, muphar mowo mo pwa sabchi buruba yisha?&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yahudawa a Wunje Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Na Gagu o Bigenje be e guzagu ne henda na urushalima, <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />Gagu uni na shiya henda, Yesu henda e be ringachaga na so shirayi she sulemanu na so yaba e Onhon. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Pa ayahudawa a shagi ek makita, ab ange na Yesu &lt;&lt;Har hwane gabwa to ge na edumta̱ e bishina̱? shi gab shi Botʻbwakimga to tuzama sabchiya.&gt;&gt;. <verse eid="JHN 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Pa Yesu e chane yek nyange, &lt;&lt;Ai, na me zwama, e yado ba. Enk ana a gyam ragashi na reze re Buchi na bumi, a on sheda numi. <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />Ama gahi e tanomahinda ba, zwam gahi yo na so bangu o tami nimi ba. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Tami nimi a raga bake bigwaba nabimi, na daki yek, tami nimi ena ragaga henda. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />Na panga yek muhondo mo dududu, ba henda nya u ba dududu aza henda bone bo pwa che yek na wa nimiya. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Buchi na bumi bone bona pa tami ni bo hyange kuchi tuwaga, aza henda bone bo pwa che yek bando iko e Buchi. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Gyam na Buchi tushi yink.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Pa yahudawa a hyangaka te a tage Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Pa Yesu nyange na yahyudawa, &lt;&lt;Name chibano enk a bura̱̱ dinya ana a sher wo Buchi, zwam iyahyani ana a gahi hina tagaga na te?&gt;&gt;. <verse eid="JHN 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Pa Yahudawa a chane ange,&lt;&lt;Ba zwam enk a mai a bura̱̱ gatwa bo tagaga ba, se zwam gab shi bot ama gab on kana ringyatumaga Onhon.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Pa Yesu e chane yek nyange,&lt;&lt;Ba oyo herange na hadoba nahi nezwama, Na zwame gahi mu onhon ba? <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />To, shi ane a taaje Onhon o korewa yek a zwame naba mu'onhon &lt; Nasi henda a pwa anshigatumo oik ba&gt;, <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />Nya zwame na bone bo Onhon o yinga otuma henda na duniya, &lt;Taje o makwada gab on,&gt; Zwam gyam zwame, &lt;Gyam shi Bwa bo Onhon? <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Shi enk a Buchi nabumi bo shagu gyam onshi ba, to, eta tanamahinda na gyamu. <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />Ama shi ab ne gyamu onshi, ko e tanomahinda na gyamu ko etano ba, to, e tane mahinda na enk zwame e daki, e gane henda na yo na so Buchi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Pa yek a kisane e kudaga a huma Yesu, ama e sher bando wa yaba. <verse eid="JHN 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Katomo Yesu e maringyaka hiro o rwaga o urdun, rihuga re yohana e rwage shaga Baptisma, e shani pate . <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Ato dinya henda a kore wo Yesu a be zwammagaa, &lt;&lt;Tamahinda, Yohana eshiu iya hyani e mai ba, ama kuchi ene e Yohana e zwame na reto re bot bote mahinda ne.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Pa ne ato dinya atanemahinda na Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s1">Uʻu o Li'azaru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Azhe bot mai bone bwaba ogago Li'azaru ishi e bot bo tonge to Betaniya bo rumagi, Betaniya ushi o shi'undu she Mariyamu na buhuwa bo mab Marta. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Mariyamu mane henda, buhunwa bo mab ma rumagi maba ne mane ma sukutage Botʻbutuwaga manebe ma washi o tusungo, ma sungage henda bone Yesu na tuhinja to reto remaba. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Pa ahuwa a twaa a tomane na tutom wo Botʻbutuwaga a zwama boik nezwama buchagiya bo bob bo bura̱̱ bo rumagi. <verse eid="JHN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Na Yesu e hoge nani nyange, &lt;&lt;Irumagu e ni, Ishi uʻu ba, zwam a dande Onhon ne, henda a dande Bwa bo Onhon Bando eb.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Yesu henda e kudage Marta na buhuwa bo mab na henda Li azaru. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Kuchinanani, na Yesu e hoge li'azaru e rumagi pa eb e kesane muget murya. <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Na yesa o nani pa Yesu nyange na aswabo a bone eb,&lt;&lt;Tu maringyaka tonge to yahudaya&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Aswabo ani ange na Yesu,&lt;&lt;Ama Umarumi ba na ewarago ba yahudawa a kudage a bu tagage na te, bwa maringyaka wariya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Pa Yesu e chane nyange,&lt;&lt;Ba berom be rikwape na ryari huru owinka ba? koga bone bo on tuhano na onhwanho bwashi odubuta ba, zwam bo raga hyanaga tubanga to duniya uni <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Ama koga bone bo on tuhano na ageta bo shagu odubuta, zwam bo za tubanga bando bob.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Na Yesu e zwame nani pa eb e kisane zwammagaa,&lt;&lt;Buchigiya na buti Li'azaru e rabuche, ama na kore na a o shinge ek &gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Pa aswabo ane ange na Yesu,&lt;&lt;Ga Botʻbutuwaga, Shi e on murabo nya mashingeu.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Yeusu e on Li'azaru e u, ama yek a on nezwama murab ne suba Li'azaru e on. <verse eid="JHN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Pa Yesu e zwama yek sabchiya, nyange, &lt;&lt;Li'azaru henda e u. <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />Na hogo tusongo zwam nayo pateya wo Li'azaru e u ba, zwama yanzu gahi hiu rihuga re tano e so wo gyam. kuryanji wo eb.<verse eid="JHN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Pa Toma ene nyaba ugage a gira e zwama ahuwa a eb aswabo, &lt;&lt;Gatu ma to kore, gatu ma tu taba na eba &gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu e anshingatumo Li'azaru Bando uʻu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Na Yesu e kore, e bangi Li'azaru, e shiu muget mo nashi na u'uyi. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Betanya henda beyo kusa na urashalima egagau e mil urya. <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />Yahudawa dinya a kore a shagi Marta na mariyamu ozwano o nagu o buhuwa bwaba. <verse eid="JHN 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Na e hogo e Yesu e on kore pa Marta mane masumga Yesu, mariyamu henda ma shani na yaba. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Pa Marta mange na Yesu ,&lt;&lt;Gab Botʻbutuwaga, shi bu ka yo pa buhuwa na bumi bo ka u ba. <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Ama ko nare ma henda na daki Onhon owaboshagiu ene e gab kaba oik. <verse eid="JHN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Pa Yesu nyange na Marta, &lt;&lt;Buhuwa na bobe bwa mashingeu.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Pa marte mange na Yesu,&lt;&lt;Na daki nyamashingeu oho owashinga o ana owagi oho a kundaga. <verse eid="JHN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Pa Yesu nyangwe na marta, &lt;&lt;Ai gyamshi owashinga o ana owagi gyamshi henda muhondo, bone bo tanomahinda wo gyamu ko bu'u bwamashin geu. <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />Bone henda boyo na muhondo, bo on henda tanamahinda wo gyam bwa u ba dududu. bo yada naniya?&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Martamange na Yesu, &lt;&lt;I Gab Bott-butuwaga na tanomahinda gab shi Botʻbwakimga Bwa bo Onhon, bone bo on kore na duniya.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Ishi mishi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Na marta ma zwame nani, pa mab ma kore ma ogage buhuwa bo mab mariyamu, ma pyakura mek mange, &lt;&lt;Umarumi o yo pani, obo ogago.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Mariyamu ma hoge nani, pa mab ma mashinge gyaugyabo makore wo ob. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Yesu gagu uni re eso shi'udu shiniba katomo har nare eyo pani pa marta ma sambuga yek. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Na yahudawa ane ayo taba na mariyamu na so yaba, a be shagi mek ozwano o nagu, pa yek hya mariyamu ma mashinge masher, pa yek swabe mek, nezwama ko makore wo u'uyi, mashi tudaro wari.<verse eid="JHN 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Na mariyamu ma kore wo Yesu e yo, ma hya ek, pa maba ma hinage na bishina̱ be Yesu mange, &lt;&lt;Gab Botʻbutuwaga, shi buka yo pa buhuwa na bumi buka uba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Na Yesu e hya mariyamu mabeshi tudaro, yahudawa ana a ragaga mak ab mashi masi tudaro, pa Yesu e kumbe kamabari kagu o so, ebarika̱gu e so mahinda. <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />Yesu henda nyange,&lt;&lt;Pa gahi tane li'azaru?&gt;&gt; yek ange na Yesu &lt;&lt;Gab Botʻbutuwaga, kurya, kurya o hya.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Pa Yesu ishi mishi. <verse eid="JHN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Zwam nani pa yahudawa a zwame hingyana ta eb e on tukudago to Li'azaru.<verse eid="JHN 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Ama a mai ange, &lt;&lt;Ashe, bone bo sabchi buruba buni yisha, bo pwa sanso bot buni uʻu ba?&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu e Anshinga Li'azaru Bando uʻu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Pa Yesu e ma barika̠ga̠ na sowa eb, pa eb e kore u'uyi, uni henda byara o te ne, nate o mai henda ab sabta yinu u'uyi uni. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Yesu nyange, &lt;&lt;E swabke te uni,&gt;&gt; pa Marta, buhuwa bo li'azaru ana. u, mange na Yesu, &lt;&lt;Gab Botʻbutuwaga, ai, nare ishiu wanshe, zwam nare mugeta mo nashi na uʻu &gt;&gt;. <verse eid="JHN 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Pa Yesu nyange na Marta, &lt;&lt;Nabo zwama ba, shi bo tano mahinda bwa hya e dan edanduwa Onhon?&gt;&gt;. <verse eid="JHN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Pa yek swabke te uni. Yesu henda e dande reto zaat, nyange, &lt;&lt;Gab buchi nabo godu zwam gab na bake. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Ko da na daki boraga kana bakyaga, ama na zwame nani zwam ato ani ayo pani taba na gyamu nezwam ayaje gab na tuma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Ta Yesu e zwame nani pa eb e dande bigwaba dinya nyange Li'azaru mashinge!&gt;&gt;. <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Pa bone bu u bu sher, bona na wa parage, na likapani shinu eb henda parage na a zwanzu. Yesu nyange na ba,&lt;&lt; E pashingyagi ek e karige&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A shiu Yinu Yink Zwam A hone Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Zwam nani Yahudawa dinya, ana a kore wo mariyamu, a hya ene e pare, ange ayaje na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Ama a mai wo ab a kore wo parisiyawa a zwame yek ene e Yesu ishi. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Zwam nani pristochi a tuwaga na parisiyawa a tarage ato majalisa, ange, &lt;&lt; Shin nya gatu on shi har bot buni bwashi iya hyani dinya naniya?. <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Shi tu ge ek nani, koga bwayado na eb, Romawa henda a karige a che tonge na tuti, a zhangi ato nati.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Boink bando ato, a ogage boik Kayapa, bone bushi Pristi e tuwaga na gagu uni, nyange naba, &lt;&lt; Gahi de e daki ko nya ba. <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />E shagu mongeu ba, ai o hyange bot boink bando nuhi bu u zwam ato na kuchi ato a ni a u.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Ba na e kudago e eb e zwam nani ba, se zwam eb ne ishi Prisiti e tuwaga na gagu uni ishiu iyahyanagu nezwama, Yesu nya u zwam ato kuchi. <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />Ba zwam ato suba ba, har etarage awo a Onhon na ana ayo gatagage ko pa ashi ink. <verse eid="JHN 11:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Na oho uni ne ab a para yinu a hone Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Zwamnani, na Yesu e kisano shi tuhano na so Yahudawa sabchiya ba, ama e mashinge pate e kore tonge tone to yo na gungu o uzanga, e eshe shepo o mai, o reze Epraimu. Pate eb e shani na aswabo a bone eb.<verse eid="JHN 11:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Ab pab, begenjhe be Yahudawa be nya kore, ato dinya wari na shi'undu a kore Urushalima a guzagi turi twaba kape begenjhe. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Pa yek a kumbe mungeu mo Yesu ab yesangane na Egenga, ab kama zwama, &lt;&lt;Nya gahi hya? Henda nya kore begenjhe?. <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Zwam da Pristochi a tuwaga a shiu esapo, koga bone bo daki wo Yesu e yo, bo kore bozwame, yeka kumbe ek.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s1">A Sukutago Yesu Manebe Na Betani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Zwamanani begenje be e kachowa be rayanta mugeta mo tunihi, pa Yesu e kore Betani pane pa Li'azaru e yo, ene e Yesu e anshigatume bando uʻu. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Pate ab shegi ek kuryago ko rembe,marta mabane mashi kurago kuni Li'azaru henda e yo bando ana on re kuryago kuni. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Pa mariyamu ma zhangi e chano ink e manebe ma washe o tusongo ma nardi mabmaba ma kurubi dinya pa maba ma sukuta na bune Yesu, Pa bob bo susunga na tu hinjha to reto re bob. Kuchi yaba ini e houtura na washe o tusongo to manebe mani <verse eid="JHN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Ama Yahuza Iskariyoti ene e yo bando aswabo a bone Yesu, bone bwa tuta ek nyange, <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />Nya e yanshe a sange maneb mani na kurubi Buyini bo tato, a panga ana a nagi kurubi eniya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />E zwame nani henda, ba zwama e raga yingyaga ana a ungage ba, a'a, se zwam eb ishi buhi, zwam henda etu e kurubi nyaba eyo na wa eb, e raga da̱ra̱ga̱ bando ene nyaba zhe. <verse eid="JHN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Pa Yesu nyange, &lt;&lt; Ge boik shi buka iru zwam oho uʻu numi. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Ai, ko hwane e yo na unga, ama ba ko hwane gahi yo na gyamu ba.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A Para Yinu Bitaga Na Li'azaru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Na udubu o ato Yahudawa o hoge nabare nezwama Yesu eyo pate, pa yek a kore, ba zwam Yesu eb eba ba, zwam henda yek a hya Li'azaru ene e Yesu e anshingyatume bando ana a owagi. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Pa a tuwaga a Pristochi a ma iri yinu o e hono e Li'azaru taba, <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />a sha na ni zwam li'azaru ne ato yahudawa dinya a on wonje a tuwaga ani a be kama maringyaga a be tanaga so bando Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ato Urushalima a Cheu Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Na bungo o bunge udubu one o kore bigenje, taba hoge Yesu e on kore Urushalima. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />Pa ab a hyangi huma a eʻo shewa a sher zwam a sumbuga Yesu, a be dandaga bigwaba a be zwammagaa, &lt;&lt; A dande Onhon! Yibura e tabachi wo bone bo on kore na reze re Botʻbutuwaga, Onhon o tane bugwam bo ato Israila!&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Na Yesu e hi azhanke a mai pa eb e hyane, ta ob oyo herange,<verse eid="JHN 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />Eta hoga ryansa, Gab shepo o Sihiyona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:15">Bugwam na buhi a bona kore,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:15">Bu on kore zaat o a ragasu azhanke.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Na Jigu, aswabo a bone Yesu a daki iri ni ba, Ama na yesa owaba dando ek, pa ato ani ama butare nezwama shetak she taaje Onhon she zwam nani na reto re eb nani henda ab shagi ek.<verse eid="JHN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Na udubu one o yo pane pa Yesu e ogage Li'azaru e sher na so u'uyi, e anshiga ek bando ana a owagi, ab a raga zwammagaa kuchi ne e ab shi. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Obo sa udubu o ato okore o sumbuga ek zwam a hoge e shiu yiya hyani ani. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Pa Parisiyawa ama zwama hato haba, &lt;&lt;Hyananji! Aza ene e gatu pwasi! Ai, ato duniya kuchi a yo na yensa o eb.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A mai Hiliniyawa a On Mungewa mo Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />To, na so ana a kore begenge be e sha e sujada azhe Hiliniyawa a mai. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Pa ab a kore wo Pilibus ishi e bot bo Betsaida o tonge to Galili, ab a kaba boik ange, &lt;&lt; Butusha,yu on kudaga tuma zwane na Yesu.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Pa Pilibus e kore e zwama Andarawus, Andarawus na Pilibus henda yeka a kore taba, azwama Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Pa Yesu e chane yek nyange, &lt;&lt; Gagu o shiu owaba dande Bwa bot. <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Lelle tamahinda, na raga ke zwammagaa, shi awumba <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Kuchi bone bo kudago muhondo mo bob bwa nagu moik. Bone henda bo wondo muhondo mo bob zwam gyam na duniya nuni, bwa hi moik, koro muhondo mo dududu. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" /><verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu e Shiu Taje o Uʻu Eb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />&lt;&lt;Yanzu na on hoge tuchara. nya gyamwa zwamo henda? Na zwamo Buchi na zhagya gagu uni. A'a ai nakurwa zwam gagu uni. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Buchi o dande reze nebe!&gt;&gt;.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:28">Pa begwabo be sher wari na zaat byange, &lt;&lt; Naraga na dendeu reze nebe, na dande ek henda.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Na udubu uni o yo pate o hoge taaje uni, pa ab ange.&lt;&lt; A shiu rumana&gt;&gt; ato mai henda ange, &lt;&lt; Butuma bo hagamba ne bo shi ek taaje.&gt;&gt;. <verse eid="JHN 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Pa Yesu e chane nyange, &lt;&lt; Ba zwam gyam ab shi bigwaba bini ba, se zwam gahi. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Yanzu ubush gagu owaba shagi ato duniya uni hadoba, yanzu ne ab bwajigya bugwam bo ato duniya uni. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Gyam henda gagu ab na zhangu gyamu koro turwana na numu ato kuchi wo gyamu.&gt;&gt;. <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Bando e zwamo ini eb e chibane uʻu o eb nyashi.<verse eid="JHN 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Pa udubu uni o chane Yesu owange, &lt;&lt; Hadoba nati atuzwama, nezwama, Botʻbwakimga bwa nya dududu. To, inga ta gabwa zwamo a dande bwa bot? Ga bushi bwa bot buni?&gt;&gt;. <verse eid="JHN 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Yesu e chane, &lt;&lt; tubanga twa nyana gahi koro o gagu chimu pani tusha. Ishi tuhano na so tubanga tuni zwam tushi to ka me sabt. bone bo on tuhano na so tushi bo daki wo bob bo on tanaga buna ba. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />E yaje na tubanga tuni, tun gahi yo taba na tuba, zwam gahishi ato tubanga.&gt;&gt;.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:36">Yesu e zwame nani, katomo e kore e ma swe na Yahudawa.<verse eid="JHN 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yahudawa a Yado Na Yesu Ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Ama ko na ob oyo e shagu iyahyani dinya na bishina̱ byaba, kuchi nanani yek a tanoso na eb ba, <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />Zwam a shinji ene e butuma Ishaya e zwame nezwama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">Gab Botʻbutuwaga, ga bo tanoso na taaje nuti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:38">Wo ga Botʻbutuwaga bo shiryatume mahonre boba?&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Obo sa ab a pwa tano so ba. zwam Ishaya e zwamagaaka,<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />Onhon o sabta yisha ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">O sabta hakoko haba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">Zwam yishaba a ta hya koya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">Henda hakoko haba a ta daka konya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">Onhon Owange yeka maringeu wo gyamu ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">Zwam gyamu e rumigi yek.<verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Ishaya e zwame nani zwam e hya e dan edanduwa e Botʻbwakimga, e zwama ga henda taaje o eb.<verse eid="JHN 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Kuchi nanani, ato dinya har na so ato tuwaga ma a tano mahinda na eb, ama zwam e hogo e ryansa a Yahudawa, yek a tanoso ba, zwam a ta sheratuma yek bando ato. <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />Zwam a kudage e edanduwa e ato na e dan edanduwa e Onhon.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Taje o Yesu Owa Shirya Hadoba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Pa Yesu e dande bigwaba nyange, &lt;&lt; Bone bo on tanaga so na gyam,ba na gyamu-gyamu bob bo non tanaga so ba ama taba na bone bona tuma. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Kuchi bone bo on kana yingyaga henda bo on yingyaga bone bo natuma. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Na kore wo duniya ta tubanga, zwam kuchi bone bu na tano so wo gyam buta shaga na tushi. <verse eid="JHN 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Ko ga bone bo shagu ene gyamzwame bo on henda getaga oik ba, na shereu boik hadoba ba. nakore e shereu ato duniya hadoba ba ama e chage yek. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Bone bona wondo, bu cheu henda taaje numi ba, bozhe bone bwa shereu boik hadoba, taaje o gyam zwame ob owa shereu boik hadoba oho o akundaga! <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Ba henda zwam reto rinimi gyam on taaje ba, Buchi na bumi bone bona tuma bob na reto rebob bona pa esapo bando ene e gyamwa zwam, na henda taaje o gyamwa shi. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Na daki de esapo ete e bob muhondo ne mo dududu. Zwam nani, ene e gyam raga zwammagaa eyo ink na ene e Buchi na bumi bona tuma.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu e Guzagi Bune Aswabo a Bone eb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Ab pab kape begeje be kachiwa, na Yesu e hya gagu o shiu one eb nya mashingeu pani na duniya e maringe wo Buchi, kuchi nezwama e kudago ato eb a duniya uni, e kudago yek dinya har koro akundaga. <verse eid="JHN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Ab na so ere e kuryago ko rembe, Ibilis henda erego etano na so yahuza iskariyati bwa bo saminu e tuta Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Yesu henda, shi eb e daki Buchi bo tano mahonre ma ko nya na wa eb Yesu e daki henda e sher wo Onhon eb e sher Wo Onhon henda eb nya maringeu. <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />Pa Yesu e mashinge bando ere e kurya kuni, pa eb e iri a po a eb hasa, na eb e zhagi ezane ishi damura na eb. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />katomo eb e zuta mani na so ugyabu, eb e rwage guzaga bone aswabo a bone eb, eb susuganga na matana mane ma eb ishi damura na mab. <verse eid="JHN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Na Yesu e eshe bando Bitrus, Bitrus henda byange na Yesu,&lt;&lt;Gab Bot-butuwaga,ashe, gab ne bwana guza bona nimi?&gt;&gt;. <verse eid="JHN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Pa Yesu e chane nyange, &lt;&lt;Nare kam bo daki ene e gyam onshiba, ama pani tusha bwa daku.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Bitrus byange na Yesu, &lt;&lt;Gyam ga! Ai, bwa na kuza buna har dududu!&gt;&gt; Pa Yesu echane bek nyange, &lt;&lt;Shi nabo kuzagu ba, boza ketope wo gyamu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Bitrus byange na Yesu, &lt;&lt;Gab Botʻbutuwaga, bama bona nimi suba ba har na wa nimi na reto nimi taba!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Pa Yesu nyange na Bitrus, &lt;&lt;Kuchi bone bo shiu zhiya boza rihuga rebob bwa kudago eguzhagu, se bone e bob suba, zwam bo rego bu ma guzagu kuchi, gahi ma eyo guzagi, ama ba kuchi nuhi ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Zwam Yesu e daki bone bwa tuta ek obo sa eb e zwame, &lt;&lt;Ba kuchi nuhi eyo guzagi ba.&gt;&gt;. <verse eid="JHN 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Na Yesu e guzagi bone aswabo a eb, pa eb e buda a po a hasa a eb, pa Yesu e ma banbyaka, nyange na aswabo a bone eb, e daki ene e gyame shagiya? <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />E raga kana ogaga Umarumi, na henda Botʻbutuwaga, oyo honzhe henda, zwam nani gyam yo. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Shi oboshi gyam Botʻbutuwaga na buhi na Umarumi nuhi, name guzagi bona, ashe, gahi ma oyo honzhe e guzagi bone e hato nahi. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Name shegi iyi egagau zwama gahi ma e kore e shagi ato mai ta gyame shagi. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Lelle tamahinda, na ragake zwammagaa, bugyam bo hyange Buchi bo yaba e bob ba, butuma henda bo hyange bone bo tuma boik ba. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Shi henda e daki mahinda, gahi henda shaga mahinda gahishi ato so chen.<verse eid="JHN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />Ba kuchi nuhi gyam on ba. Na daki ane a gyam yinga. uni henda kuchi zwama ashin nasinezwama, &lt;Bone bo on re kuryago taba na gyamu bushi bone bo na wunje.&gt; <verse eid="JHN 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />Tun nare name zwama iyi tun e shiu ba, zwam gagu eb e shiu etane mahinda gyamshi bob ta gyam yo. <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Lelle tamhinda, naraga ke zwammagaa, bone boshiu eyado kuchi na bone bo gyam tuma boshiu eyado na gyam ba unu. Bone bo shiu eyado na gyam henda boshiu eyado na bone bona tumane.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Nyange A tuta Ek.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Yesa o Yesu e zwame nani, e hoge tuchara na so eb, ishi sheda nyange, &lt;&lt;Lelle tamahinda na on kame zwammagaa, boink bando nuhi bwana tuta.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Pa aswabo ani ama yingyaga hato haba, ana nagi bone bo Yesu e on na bob. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Boik bando aswabo a bone eb henda, bone bo Yesu e hyange kudaga, bob banbigiya kusa na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Pa Bitrus byange na bone bo yo kusa na Yesu byange,&lt;&lt;Tuzwama e on na gamba nai?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Bob henda bone bo bob bo boyo banbigiya kusa na Yesu bo ma barki, bwange na Yesu, &lt;&lt;Gab Botʻbutuwaga ga nai?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Pa Yesu e chane boik nyange, &lt;&lt;Bob ne bone bo gyamwa tana byasana umepa boik&gt;&gt; Na Yesu e tana byasana uni henda, pa eb e pa yahuza, bwa bo saminu iskariyoti. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Na e che e byasana uni henda pa bugwam bo muphar bo eshe so rekoko re eb. pa Yesu nyange na eb, &lt;&lt;Mahima ushi ene gabwa shi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Ama bando aswabo a bone eb ana a on re kuryago, aza bone bo daki ene e sa Yesu e zwama Yahuda naniya. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Har ato mai a on nezwama Yesu e zwamma ek ishi muyinsa na begenje bini ne, ko henda e tuta munyare iyimaya, zwam yahuda eb ne eyo na ituwa e kurubi nyaba. <verse eid="JHN 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Yahuda henda na e cheu e byasana uni, pa e sher, gagu uni henda na ageta ne.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Esapo E upo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Yensa o yahuda e sher henda pa Yesu nyange,&lt;&lt;Yanzu henda ab dande bwa bot, ab handa a dande Onhon bando bwa. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />Onhon henda owadande bwa wo e dan edanduwa ob, onhon owa chibano e dan edanduwa e ob bando bwa bot, kapaba henda ob owa dando boik. <verse eid="JHN 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />Gahi awo nami a nuwa, gagu chimu o ryanta̱ gyam taba na gahi, Nyana yingyaga, ama ta gyam zwama yahudawa ne zwama, &lt;Wo gyamwa karige e pwa koro ba, &gt; Nani gyam on kame zwammagaa yanzu. <verse eid="JHN 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />Esapo e upo gyam on kame tuta, ushiu dole e kudage hato nahi. Ta gyame kudage nani koga bwa daku gahishi aswabo a bona nami, shi e on kana kudaga hato nahi,&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Nanani ko ga bwa daku gahi shi aswabo a buna nimi ne shi de e yo na tukudago to hato nahi &gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bitrus Byashi Muwondo mo Edaku e Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Ab pab pa Bitrus byange na Yesu,&lt;&lt;Gab Bot-butuwaga, bwa koro pa?&gt;&gt; pa Yesu e chane nyangya, &lt;&lt;wo gyamwa karege bo pwa koro nare ba ama na yensa bwa na swabya&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Pa Bitrus byange na Yesu, &lt;&lt;Ga Botʻbutuwaga zwam nya, gyamwa pwa kabo swabo yenzu ba? Ai, na tuta muhondo namumi zwam gab.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Pa Yesu e chane nyange, &lt;&lt;Ashe, bwa tuta muhundo na mobe zwam gyamu? Lelle tamahinda, na raga kezwamagaa, kame oraguna oshi tudaro, bwashi o nagu edaku nimi katato.<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu Ishi Yena O Koro Wo Buchi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />Yesu e zwama aswabo a bone eb , &lt;&lt; Eta madamaga. Etane so na Onhon, etane so na gyamu henda. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Wo buchi na bumi azhe rihuga dinya. Shi ba nani ba, shika me zwama, zwam na kore e me kimga rihuga. <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Shi henda na karigeu na me kimga rihuga, se emaringe na me zhangi wo gyamu yo, zwam wo gyam yo, gahi ma e nya pate. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Wo gyamwa karige e daki yena.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Pa Toma nyange na Yesu, &lt;&lt; Gab Botʻbutuwaga, gatu daki wo gabwa karige ba, inga ta gatwa daku yena uniya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Pa Yesu nyange na Toma,&lt;&lt; Gyamushi yena, gyamushi mahinda, gyamushi henda bone bo panga muhondo. Aza bone bo pwa eso yo Buchi se bando numi. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Yesu nyange na aswabo a bone eb, Yanzu shi ena daki gyamu, yek daku Buchi na bumi. Ama nare e daki boik, henda e hya boik.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Pa Pilibus nyange na Yesu, &lt;&lt; Gab Botʻbutuwaga, tu bisani Buchi buni, ene e gatu kudage binu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Pa Yesu nyange na Toma, &lt;&lt; Na warago na gahi dinya har nare bona daki gyamu ba Pilibus, ai kuchi bone bona hya gyamu ai bo hya Buchi buni. Inga ta gabwa zwame tu bini Buchi buni&gt;? <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Wato boyado nezwama nayo na so Buchi ba, Buchi henda na so numiya? Taje o gyam on kame zwammagaa ba na mahonre na mami gyam on kame zwammagaa ba Buchi ne bone bo yo na so numi bobe shagu enk a bob. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Etane mahinda na gyam zwame nayo naso Buchi, Buchi henda na so numi, ko henda e yaje nagyamu zwam enk a gyamu onshi. <verse eid="JHN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />Lelle tamahinda, naraga ke zwammagaa, kuchi bone bo on tanagamahinda na gyamu enk a gyamu raga shagu bob ma bwashi nani. Har hyange na ane a gyamu shagu, zwam na karige wo Buchi. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Na me shagiu kuchi ene e gahi kaba na reze rinimi, zwam a dande Buchi bando o Bwa. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Ko nya gahi kaba na reze rinimi name shagiu.<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A nakawari a Uhunchi o Bura̱̱</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />Yesu nyange na aswabo a bone eb, &lt;&lt; Shi ena kudage, nya swabo esapo nimi. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />Zwamanani, gyam ma na kaba Buchi, bwa henda bo me pa bomai bo ebanga̱ bo nya taba na gahi dududu. <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />O ebanga̱ ete ne uhunchi one o raga chibaga mahinda ma Onhon. One o ato duniya o pwa hi oik ba, zwam o hyanagu oik ba, o daki henda oik ba. Gahi henda, e daki oik, zwam oyo shani taba na gahi, owanya henda na so nahi.<verse eid="JHN 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />Yesu nyange, &lt;&lt; Shi na karegeu, na me ge marayu ba, na maringyaka wo gahi. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Mugeta mo sa yo chimu ato duniya a na hyanaka ba, ama gahi nya hyanaka. Zwam gyamu yo na muhondo, gahi ma nya, nya na muhondo. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Shi oho uni o kurwa, nya daku gyam yo na so Buchi, gahi henda na so numi gyamu henda na so nuhi. <verse eid="JHN 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />Kuchi bone bo yado na esapo nimi, bo on henda swabe oik boba ne bo na kudage. Bone bo na kudage henda Buchi na bumi bwa kudaga boik, gyamu henda na kudaga boik, echibane reto rinimi wo bob.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Pa Yahuza Ba yahuza Iskariyoti ba Nyange, &lt;&lt; Gab Botʻbutuwaga, zwam nya gabwa chibano reto renebe wo gatu, ba wo ato duniya ba?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Pa Yesu e chane Yahuza nyange, &lt;&lt; Ko ga bona kudage, bwa geto taaje numi,Buchi na bumi henda bwa kudaga boik, twakore wo Buchi tu shani taba. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Bone bo na kudagewa, bo getagiwa taaje numiya. Taje one o gahi raga hogaga ushi numi ba, ushi o Buchi bone bona tumane .<verse eid="JHN 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />Yesu nyange naba, &lt;&lt; Kuchi uni name zwama ne tun gatu sayo taba. <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Ama boi banga uhunchi o bura̱̱ one o Buchi bwatuma na reze nimi, obane owame chibaga ko nya, oi butare henda ko nya e gyame zwama.<verse eid="JHN 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />Name ge na ashinya a bura̱̱, ashinya a bura̱̱ nami a gyamu on kame panga, ba ta ato duniya oraga ke panga gyamu on ke panga ba. Eta ma damaga, henda eta huga ryansa. <verse eid="JHN 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />E hogo de gyamu zwam na karige, na maringe henda wo gahi. Shi na on tukudago na tumi ekashiu makuda zwam na koro wo Buchi, zwam Buchi bona hyange gyamu. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Na me zwama nani tun e kashiu ba, zwam gagu o gahi hya e shiu e tane mahinda. <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />Na me shagyaka taaje o udubu ba, zwam bot bo tugwama to ato duniya uni bo on kore, boza henda mahonre wo gyamu. <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />Ama zwam ato duniya a daki nezwama na kudage Buchi, na on henda shagu ta Buchi bo na tuma, mashinge tu karege pani.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu Ishi eʻo Inabi e Mahinda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />Yesu nyange na aswabo a bone eb: &lt;&lt; Gyamshi eʻo e inabi e mahinda, Buchi nabumi henda bushi bot bo tuma. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Ko a na abob ana a panga awo ba, se Buchi na bumi bo sher aik, Ko ana agogo henda ana a panga awo boraga guzaga aik zwam a pa awo dinya. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Ko yanzu gahishi ana aza turiya zwam taaje one o gyam me zwama. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />E shani na so numi, gyam henda na so nuhi. Ta agogo a inabi a pwa panga awo ab ba ba, se henda ayo taba na ripitu, nani ma gahi ya pwa ba, se e shanu na so numi. <verse eid="JHN 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />Yesu nyange gyamshi eʻo inabi ini, gahi henda shebobwa shini. Bone bo shanu na so numi, gyam henda na so bob, boba ne bo panga awo dinya. Zwam shi ba taba na gyam ba, e pwashi konya ba. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Kuchi bone bo shana na so numi ba, a taga boik pate, bo yo ta agogo, bu hwae, a zuranga iri ab tane na so ora. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Shi shanu na so numi, taaje numi henda o shanu na so nuhi, nya kaba kuchi ene e gahi kudage, a me pa henda. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Nani ab dandaga buchi na bumi ba un, shi e on awo dinya, nanani henda gahishi aswabo nami a mahinda. <verse eid="JHN 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />Na me kudage Ta buchi bona kudage, e shani bando tukudago tone to gyam on kame shagya. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Shi swabo esapo nimi, nyashana na so tukudago tone to gyam on kame shagi, ta gyam swabe esapo e buchi na bumi na shanu henda bando tukudago tone to bob bo raga kana shagya.<verse eid="JHN 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />Na me zwama nani zwama so chen numi o yo na so nuhi, so chen nuhi henda ushinji. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />Uni ubushi esapo nimi, nezwama e ma kudage hato nahi, ta gyame kudage. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Aza tukudago tone to hyange naniya bando achagiya, wato bot pa muhonda mo boba zwam ana ashi achagiya a bob. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Gahishi achagiya nami a gyam yaje naba shi on shaga ene e gyame sape <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Name ogagaka agyam ba, zwam bugyam bo daki ene e buchi bo yaba e bob bo on shi ba, se e zwame na gahi achagiya, zwam na me zwama kuchi ene e gyam hoge wo buchi na bumi. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Ba gahi ena yinga gyam ba, gyamu ne me yinga, na me sa e kore e matage awo dinya ta eʻo awo ana ayo dududu, zwam uni konya kahi kaba buchi na reze nimi Buchi na bumi bwa bo me pa. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Uni oboshi sapo nimi e upo e kudaga hato nahi.<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ato Duniya a On Bitaga Na Aswabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />Yesu e kisane zwammagaa, &lt;&lt;Shi ato duniya a me wondo, e daki se naba nawonje gyam katumo ab me wonje gahi. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Shi gahishi ato duniya o ka kudago ato ob, ama zwam gahishi ato duniya ba, name yinga bando ato duniya, obo sa ato duniya a me wonje. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Emakimga butare na taaje o gyame zwama ne zwama, &lt; Bugyam bo hyange Buchi bo yaba e bob ba.&gt; Shi yek ana panga maduru, gahi ma a me pa maduru. Shi yek ana get taaje numi, yekaka get taaje nuhi taba. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Ama kuchi a me shagiu konya zwam gahishi nami, zwam yek a daki bone bona tuma ba. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Shi naka kore zwam e shagi yek taaje Onhon ba, yek kaza turiya. Ama nare kam, yeka kaza tugyabo-gyabo tomaya twaba pa, zwam turiya twaba. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Bone bu na wondo gyam bu wondo Buchi na bumi taba. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Shi naka shiu iyi maya ba bando ab, ene e bot maya bo tabo shi ba, da yeka kaza turiya. Ama yanzu yek a hya, yek henda atu wondo, gyam na buchi nabumi kuchi. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Ashi iri ni kuchi zwam a shinji ene eyo herange na so atak a hadoba ab ne zwama, &lt; Ana woje suba.&gt; <verse eid="JHN 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />Ama gagu o bot boi banga bo korwa bone bo gyame tumage bando Buchi, wato uhunchi o mahinda, one o raga sheraga bando Buchi, oba owashi taaje zwam gyamu. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Gahi ma nyashi taaje zwam gyam, zwam tun na Jigu eyo taba na gyamu.<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu E Reu Tusha Na Taje.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />Yesu nyange na aswabo a bone eb, &lt;&lt; Na me zwama iri ni zwam eta hi iyi ehinago bando etano'emahinda nihi. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />A me shiryatomo bando rihuga re kamaharago rya Yahudawa. Tamahinda, gagu o on kore one o koga bo me hone, bwange tugyama to Onhon bob bo onshi. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Yekashi nani henda zwam a daki Buchi ko gyam ba. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Ama name zwama irini ne, shi gagu o shiu one owaba me shagiu iri ni, nya mabutariya nezwama name zwama&gt;&gt;.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 16:4">Enk A Uhunchi O Bura̱̱</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">Na me zwama irini tun na Jigu ba, zwam nayo taba na gahi. <verse eid="JHN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />Ama nare henda na koro wo bone bona tumane, kuchi nani wo gahi, aza bone bona kaba, &lt; Bwa koro pa?&gt; <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Ama zwam name zwama irini, higyana gahya buna na so shiri dinya <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Ama Kuchi nanani na on kame zwammagaa mahinda, o mehyango e kore, zwam shi na karigeu ba, bot bo e banga ini bwa koro wo gahi ba. Shi henda na karigeu natuma boik wo gahi. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Gagu henda o bob bo kurwa bwa yanchigeu ato duniya bando turiya, na adalchi, na henda esherya e hadoba a Onhon. <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />Wato bando turiya, zwam yek a tanomahinda wo gyam ba. <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />Bando adalchi zwam na koro wo Buchi, ba henda nyana hyanaka ba. <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />Bando eshereu e hadoba henda, zwam ashereu bugwam bo duniya uni hadoba.<verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />Nazhe ene e ryanta̱ dinya ene e gyam kudage na me zwama katumo, ama e pwa zhanga̱ yek yanzu ba. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Gagu henda o uhunchi o mahinda o kore, owame banga na so mahinda, zwam owashi taaje zwam reto re ob ba, se ene e ob ohoge, e bane oba owa zwame owa henda me zwama ene nya paro. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Uhunchi owa na dande gyam, zwam owa zhangu bando ene ishi nimi ome zwama <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Kuchi ene e Buchi bozhe na so bob, ishi nimi obo sa gyamwange, uhunchi owa zhangu bando ene ishi nimi ome zwama.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">So Shiri Owamaringeu So Chen.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />Yesu e zwama aswabo a bone eb nezwama, &lt;&lt; Na gagu chimu nyana hyanaka ba, na gagu chimu henda nyana hya.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Pa aswabo a bune eb yink amazwama, &lt;&lt; Nya Yesu e on na eb nyange, &lt; Na gagu chimu nyana hya ba, na gagu chimu henda nya na hya? Na henda, &lt; Na koro wo Buchi? <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />aswabo a bone Yesu ange, &lt;&lt; Nya eb e on, &lt; Na gagu chimu&gt;, uni? Ai, tudaki ene e eb e on zwammagaa ba!&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Yesu henda e daki yeka a kudage a kaba ek, pa Yesu nyange naba &lt;&lt; Wato e on kama kabaga zwam ene e gyam zwame nezwama, &lt; Na gagu chimu nya na hya ba, na gagu chimu henda nyana hya&gt;? <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Lelle tamahinda, na on kame zwammagaa, nyashi tudaro na mesha, ama ato duniya ashi makudakuda. Gahi nya shi so shiri, ama so shiri nuhi owa maringeu makuda. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Shi bwaa bo on kama hagaga bo raga hoge maduru, zwam gagu mamata ma bob ma korwa. Ama shi bo mato apwan a bob, bo pwa kama butarya na maduru mane ma bob bo su ba, zwama makuda maba hi botuhamachie bo ato duniya <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Nani henda obo yo wo gahi, eyo na so shiri, ama na me hyanaka, gagu uni so nuhi owashi o chen, aza henda bone bo pwa che so chen nuhi.<verse eid="JHN 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />Shi oho uni o kurwa nyana kaba ko nya ba, lelle tamahinda, naraga ke zwammagaa, ko nya gahi kaba Buchi na reze rinimi bwa me pa. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Har nare de e kaba konya na reze rinimi ba; E kaba, nya hi, zwama so chen nuhi o shi udubu.<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Na shiu Nasara Na Ato Duniya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />Yesu nyange, &lt;&lt;Kuchi Irini name zwama na egagau. Gagu owa kore na me zwama na egagau ba, se de name zwama ene ishi e Buchi sabchiya. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Shi oho uni o kurwa, nyashi e kaba na reze nimi. Name zwama henda na kaba Buchi zwama gahi ba, <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />Zwam Buchi na reto re bob bo on kame kudaga, zwam gahi na kudage gyamu e yado henda na sher wo Onhon. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Bando Buchi henda gyam sher, na eshe duniya.Ama henda nage duniya e maringyaka Wo Buchi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Pa aswabo a bone Yesu ange, &lt;&lt; Yawa, Nare ne gab on taaje sabchiya, ba na egagau ba. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Nare ne gatu daki nezwama bo daki konya, ba se bot maya bo bukaba ba. Nanani ne gatu yaje nezwama gab sher bando Buchi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Pa Yesu e chane yek nyange &lt;&lt;Ashe, Nare e tanomahinda? <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />To, gagu owa kore, har ma ushiu owaba me gatagago, koga bo maringe yabe bob, e na ge gyamgyamu kuchi nanani ba gyamgyamu gyamu yo ba, zwam Buchi bo yo taba na gyamu. <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />Name zwama nani zwam wo gyam e hi ashinya a bura̱̱. Ato duniya uni a me panga maduru, ama ai, eta madamaga na shiu nasara na ato duniya.<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu Ishi menga Zwam Aswabo A bune Eb.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Na Yesu e hwagi zwama iri ni kuchi, pa eb e dande reto zaat nyange, &lt;&lt; Gab Buchi, gagu ushiu. O dande bwa nabobe zwama bwa bo bu dando. <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />Zwam gab pa boik mohonre bando ama tuhnjah, bo pa kuchi bone bo gab pa boik muhondo mo dududu. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Muhondo mo dududu henda, mobane a bu daki, onhon oik o tamahinda, na henda Yesu Botʻbwakimga bone bo gab tuma. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Na bo edanduwa ga bo onhon na duniya zwam na shindu kuchi ene e gab na tuma ishi. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Yanzu henda, gab Buchi, na dande koro zati nobe na e dande ete e gem yo na taba na gab kape duniya oyo.<verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />Yesu nyange, &lt;&lt; Na zwamago reze nebe wo ato ana a gab na tuta na so duniya. Da ma ashi nabe, henda bunatuta yek, yek get taaje nobe henda. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Yanzu henda yek a daki kuchi inyaka ene gab natuta bando nobe e be yo. <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />Zwam henda taaje o gab nazwama, nazwama yek, yek henda a cheu, yek henda a daki tamahinda na sher bando nobe, yek henda atanomahinda gab ne bona tuma. <verse eid="JHN 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />gyamna on roko zwam ab. Ba duniya gyam on kabaga ba, se de ana a gab na tuta, zwam ab shi nabe. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Kuchi anashi nami ashi nabe, kuchi anashi nabe ashi nami, henda amodanduwa na suwaba. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Yanzu henda aza ashinya nami na duniya, ama aniya ayo na duniya, gyam henda na on kore wo gab. Gab Buchi bo nagu o turiya, o getage yek na inahore ma reze re gab na pa, a kudage hato haba ta gatu yo ink. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Kuchi gagu o gatu yo taba na ba na huba yek na iko e reze rene re gab na pa. Na get yek, aza henda boik bando ab bone bo u, se bo uʻu bote, zwam nasi u shinji <verse eid="JHN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />Ama nare na on koro wo gab na on zwammagaa iri tun nasayo na duniya, zwam so chen numi ushinji na sheso shaba. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Na zwama yek taaje nobe, duniya henda o wondo yek, zwam yekashi a duniya ba, ta gyam ma nashi bo duniya ba. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Na on roko nobe o zhangi yek na duniya ba ama o geche yek na mugu o te. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Yek ashi a duniya ba, ta gyam shi bo duniya ba. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />O guzagi yek na so mahinda taaje nobe ushi mahinda mani. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Ta gab na tuma na duniya, nani ma gyam tuma yek na duniya <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Zwam yek ne gyam on tuta reto renimi, zwam yek ma a guzagi sowaba na taaje o mahinda nobe, zwam taaje nobe ushi mahinda.<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />Ba henda inyaka ani gyam on kabaga ba, taba ma na ana a on tanaga mahinda bando o taaje owaba. <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />Zwam kuchi owaba ashi ink, ta gab buchi bo yo na so numi, gyam henda na so nobe, nani ab ma ayo na so nuti, zwam duniya o tananemahida, ne zwama gab na tuma <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />E dan edanduwa ene e gab na pa, eba e gyam tuta yek, zwam yek ashi ink ta gatu yo ink. <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />Gyam na so owaba, gab henda na so muni, zwam yek ashi ink dinya, duniya o daki gab ne bona tuma, o daki henda bo kudage yek ta gab na kudage gyam. <verse eid="JHN 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />Gab Buchi, na kudage ana a gab na pa, ab ma ayo wo taba na gyamu wo gyamuyo, a hya e dan edanduwa nimi e gab na pa, zwam gab na kudage gaym tun ashi duniya. <verse eid="JHN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />Gab Buchi bo adalchi, duniya henda, obo daki ba, ama gyam bo daki gab, ato anihenda a daki nezwama gab na tuma gyam. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Na zwama yek reze nobe, nare tusha ne shagu e nani, zwam tukudago tune to gab on zwam gyamu, to yo na sowaba, gyamu ma na yo na sowaba.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s1">E Huma e Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Na yesa o Yesu e shiu menga mane, pa eb e sher, Yesu na aswabo a bone eb koro hiro o rwaga o Kidron, pane pa sanga o reho o yo, pa eb e esh na aswabo a bone eb. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Yahudama ene e tota Yesu e daki rihuga, zwam Yesu e raga kama haraga na aswabo a bune eb wariya. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Pa Yahuza henda na eb e zhangi ato gas a Roma, na a mai hadogari a Egenga bando ato tuwaga Pristochi na Parisiyawa, a kore pate, humugani na chere, na tochi. <verse eid="JHN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Yesu henda e daki kuchi ene nyaparo na eb, pa eb e makisata kusa, nyange naba, &lt;&lt; Ga gahi on mungeu?&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Pa pristochi na Parisiyawa ange, &lt;&lt;Yesu Banazare&gt;&gt;.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Yesu ange, &lt;&lt; Gyamushi eb&gt;&gt;. Yahuza henda ene e tuta Yesu eba yesane taba na ba. <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Gagu o Yesu nyange na ba, &lt;&lt; Gyamushi eb&gt;&gt;, pa yek a ma kisata na yesa, paba henage na tonge. <verse eid="JHN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Pa Yesu e kisane kaba yek, &lt;&lt; Ga gahi on yingyaga?&gt;&gt; Yek ange, &lt;&lt;Yesu Banazare&gt;&gt;. <verse eid="JHN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Na gagu uni Yesu e chane nyange, &lt;&lt; Ai, na mezwama, gyamu ne. Shi henda gyamu ne gahi on yingyaga, e ge ato ani a karige&gt;&gt;. <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Yesu e zwame nani ne zwam ashinji ene e eb e zwame ishi mahinda, nezwama, &lt;&lt; Na so ana a gab na pa na paso ko boink ba&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Simon Bitrus, henda na eb ezhe epopo e geso, e yachege ek e supi bugyam bo Pristi e oto, e yachege tobe bob o wa katuga. Reze re bugyam buni henda malkus. <verse eid="JHN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Pa Yesu nyange na Bitrus, &lt;&lt; Maringyaka epopo eb e geso na so putu! Oshiu esapo nezwama isu maduru mane ma Buchi bona tane nezwama isu&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Na Bishina̱ Be Hanana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Pa ato gas a Roma na ato tuwaga ab, na hadogari ani a Yahudawa a kumbe Yesu, a pa Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />Pa yek a zhangi Yesu wo Hanana na Jigu, zwam Hanana ashi chatogo o Kayapa, kane kashi Pristi e tuwaga na hashekara a ni. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Kayapa henda kab ka pa Yahudawa shawara nezwama, o me henge bot boink bu'u zwam ato kuchi.<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bitrus Be Shiu Nagu o Edaku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Siman ene nyaba ogo Bitrus eb na bo swabo bo mai a ragaga Yesu. Buswabo buni henda Pristi e tuwaga e daki boik honzhe, pa buswabo buni bo eshe wariya na so taba na Yesu, <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />ama Bitrus henda be yinsa na yinu eso wariya na has. Pa bomai buswabo bone bo Pristi e tuwaga e daki boik bo shere, bushi taaje na bone bo getage yinu eso, katomo bob bwange na Bitrus be esh na so. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Bugyam bo twaa bone bo on getaga yinu eso bwange na Bitrus, &lt;&lt; Anya! Gab ma boyo inka na aswabo a bot buniya?&gt;&gt;.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:17">Bitrus be chane nezwama, &lt;&lt; A'a nayo na so ab ba&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />To, agyam na hadogari a Egenga henda a gwapa ora o eʻo, zwam tuda'u to yo, ab yesagane, a be hoge ora uni. Bitrus henda be yo pate yesane taba na ba bebe hoge ora uni.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pristi e Tuwaga e Tuhimi Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Pa Pristi e tuwaga e tuhimi Yesu zwam aswabo a bone eb na henda e chibagano eb. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Yesu e chane ek nyange, &lt;&lt; Ai, na raga shaga ato duniya taaje sabchiya, na shagu henda e chibagano na so rihuga re menga na Egenga pane pa yahudawa a raga kama haraga. Na zwama ko nya na tuswen ba. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Zwam nya gab on tuhuma numi? O tuhumi ana a na bakiya bando ene e gyam zwama yek, ai yeka daki ene e gyam zwame&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Na Yesu e zwame nani, bomai bando hadogari ana ayo yinsane kusa, bo supi Yesu, bwange, &lt;&lt; Nani gabwa chano Pristi e tuwaga?&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Pa Yesu e chane ek nyange, &lt;&lt; Shi na zwame honzhe ba to, o zwame taaje bando o nani. shi henda na zwamo honzhe, to, zwam nya gabwa na supi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Pa Hanana a tuma na Yesu parage wo Kayapa, Pristi e tuwaga.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bitrus E Kisane Nagu e Daku e Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />To, Bitrus henda eb yesane bebe hoge ora. Pa yek a kaba bek, &lt;&lt; Anya! Gab ma ba boyo na so aswabo a Yesu ba?&gt;&gt; Pa Bitrus e wonje nyange, &lt;&lt; A'a na yo na so owaba ba.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Pa boink bando agyam a Pristi e tuwaga, wato dagi o bone bo Bitrus be yachige tobe, bwange, &lt;&lt; Ashe, na me hya taba na eb wariya na sanga o reho ba?&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Pa Bitrus e kisane wonje. Kapaba henda uraguna o chane yinu.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Na Bishina̱ Be Bilatus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Naba sher wo Kayapa henda, paba shibke Yesu Egenga e tugwama.Na obungonge henda, ab na reto ryaba a eso Egenga ini ba, zwam yek aka sha turiya zwam a kudage are jibi o ekacheu. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Pa Bilatus be sher na has e kaba yek, &lt;&lt; Bot buni bushi nya gahi shibkane boik wo gyam?&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Pa ato ane a shibkane Yesu ange, &lt;&lt; Shi bot buni bushi bot bo makwada ba, ai, tuka shibkane boik bando nobe ba&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Bilatus byange naba, &lt;&lt; E zhangi ek na reto rinihi naye, e shere boik hadoba bando hadoba nahi!&gt;&gt; Pa Yahudawa ange na Bilatus, &lt;&lt; Ai, tu za mahonre ma e shirya e hadoba a uʻu wo koga&gt;&gt;. <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Uni zwam a shinji taaje one o Yesu e zwame, one o gagau iri uʻu one o eb nya shi.<verse eid="JHN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Pa Bilatus be ma maringe naso Egenga, pa beb be ogage Yesu byange na eb, &lt;&lt; Ashe, gab buna, gab shi bugwam bo Yahudawa?&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Pa Yesu e chane nyange, &lt;&lt; Wato e kaba ini e sher bando nobe ubu ato mai ne a bu zwama na reto rinimi?&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Pa Bilatus be chane byange, &lt;&lt; Bo on nezwama gyamshi Bayahude? Ai, ato nabe ne na Pristochi a tuwaga ab ne a bu tuta na wa nimi, nya gab shi?&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Pa Yesu e chane nyange, &lt;&lt; Tugwama na tumi tushi to duniya uni ba. Shi tugwama natumi tushi to duniya uni da agyam nami ashi bitaga zwam gyam, zwam ata natuta bando Yahudawa. Ama tamahinda tugwama natumi tushi to ato duniya uni ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Pa Bilatus byange na Yesu, &lt;&lt;Wato gab shi bugwam?&gt;&gt; Pa Yesu e chane nyange, &lt;&lt; Ta gab zwame gyamshi bugwam. Zwam nani ne ab na machie, zwam nani ne gyam kore duniya, zwam e zwame mahinda. Koga henda bone bo kudage mahinda bwa hogo bigwaba na bimi.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Pa Bilatus byange naba, &lt;&lt; Nyanai ishi mahinda?&gt;&gt;.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 18:38">A Shireu Yesu Hadoba a Uʻu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Na yesa o Bilatus be zwame nani, pa beb be shiryaka wo Yahudawa, byange naba, &lt;&lt; Gyam kam na hya bot botiya na makwada ma konya ba. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Ama de ezhe al'ada a mai, shi begenje be e kachiwa be shiu, na raga ke taga bot boink bando ana a yo parage. To, e kudage name pashe bugwam bo Yahudawa?&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Pa yek a kisane dande bigwaba a be zwammagaa, &lt;&lt;A'a ba buni ba, se de Barabbas!&gt;&gt; Barabbas buni henda bushi bone bo chago ene e za e boba na ma honre.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Na gagu uni Bilatus be sape a karege na Yesu, a shagi ek shiduga. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Pa ato gas a shagi ek kambi o makada pa yek a tane ek na reto, Pa yek a tane ek a po a mai a mani ma tuwha. <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />a be korage wo Yesu a be zwammagaa,&lt;&lt; Muhondo mo bot butuwaga mo warage, bugwam bo ato Yahudawa!&gt;&gt;A be maranga ek. <verse eid="JHN 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Pa Bilatus be shiryaka, byange na Yahudawa, &lt;&lt; Hingyana na me shirya tumo ek, zwam e daki nezwama na bangu ek na makwada ma konya ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Pa Yesu e sher, bodane na kambi o makada mani na a po a mani ma turwa. Pa Bilatus byange na ato ani, &lt;&lt; To, bot bute a bona!&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Na ato tuwaga a Pristochi na hadogari ani a hya ek, pa yek a dande gigwabo dinya a be zwammagaa, &lt;&lt; A ginda ek, a ginda ek!&gt;&gt; Pa Bilatus byange naba, &lt;&lt; E karege na eb gahi na hato nahi, e ginda ek gyam kam na bangu ek na makwada ma mai ba&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Pa udubu uni o chane Yesu owange,&lt;&lt; Ai, tuyo na hadoba, zwam mahonre ma hadoba uni henda o kamachie a hone ek zwam e raga ogaga reto re eb Bwa bo Onhon.<verse eid="JHN 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Na Bilatus be hoge taaje uni pa beb be kisane hoge ryansa. <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />Pa beb be kisane eshe chibano, byange na Yesu, &lt;&lt;Gab sher pa?&gt;&gt; Ama Yesu e chano.<verse eid="JHN 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Zwamnani, Bilatus be zwamaka eb byange, &lt;&lt;Zwana chano ba? Bu daki nezwama gyamshi mahonre mai paso nebeya ko henda mahonre ma kabo ginda ba?&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Pa Yesu e chane ek nyange, &lt;&lt; Bu hi mahonre wo gyamu zwam Onhon o pa wariya na turwana. to, bone bona tuta wo gab bo bu nhenge turiya&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Na Bilatus be hoge nani pa eb e kudage e hi yeno o e paso e Yesu. Ama udubu owato o sanga mu'ogo dinya a be zwammagaa, shi bo paso bot bo te, gab shi buchagiya bo Kaisar ba. Ai kuchi bone bo ringyato reto re bob bugwam, bo on bitaga na Kaisar ba un!&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Na Bilatus be hoge taaje uni, pa eb e shiryatume Yesu, pa Bilatus be kore be shani na chibano o hadoba pane pa ab ogago ek ebaro, na tuyahudanchi henda, &lt;&lt;Gabbata&gt;&gt;. <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Na gagu uni henda gagu o onhwanho na reto ne oho o begenje be e kachiwa ne, pa eb nyange na a tuwaga a Yahudawa, &lt;&lt; Bugwam na buhi a buna!&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Pa udubu owato a kisane sanga mu'ogo a be zwammagaa, &lt;&lt; A hone ek! A hone ek! A ginda ek!&gt;&gt;.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Pa Bilatus be kaba yek byange, &lt;&lt; E kudage na genda bugwam na buhi?&gt;&gt;.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Pa butuwaga bo Pristochi bo chane bwange, bugwam bo gatuzhe boba ne Kaisar!&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Pa Bilatus be pa Yesu na wa yaba aginda ek.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 19:16">A Gendo Yesu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Pa ab zhangi Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Yesu e sher eba zhangi na aginda a eb har koro pani pa ab ogage rihuga re eumbu e reto, Na tuyahudanchi henda &lt;&lt;Golgota&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Paba ab a ginda Yesu na henda ato ryari boink na wa katuga boink na wa kagura.<verse eid="JHN 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Bilatus henda e herango e zwamo e mai, e tuta ek wo aginda ate. Ene nyaba herange binu, &lt;&lt; Yesu Banazare bugwam bo Yahudawa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Yahudawa dinya a herango uni uzwamo, zwam rihuga ryaba genda Yesu eyo kusa na shepo a oto henda a here ni a henrage yek na kare ka Yahudawa, na ka Romawa, na ka Helenanchi. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Na a tuwaga a pristochi a yahudawa a zwama na Bilatus,&lt;&lt;Zwam nya gab hinrange ne zwama, ebe shi bugwam bo Yahudawa? shi buka herango, &lt; eraga kana ogaga bugwam bo Yahudawa&gt; &gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Ama pa Bilatus byage naba &lt;&lt;Ene e gyam heryange asako oik ba!&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Na yesa o ato gasa a gindo Yesu, yek a zhangi matana ma Yesu a undagage mek ka nashi, ko bwana bo gas bo zhangi unda ink. Pa yek henda a zhangi matana mane ma eb, matana mani mashi ma geso maza tuyintu saka ne suba. <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Pa yek ama zwama reto ryaba nezwama, &lt;&lt; Tu ka handa aika, se de tushi ma shega bando aik, tu hya bone bwa re.&gt;&gt; Uni henda zwama a shinge ene e yo na so nassi ne zwama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">&lt;&lt; Yeka ma undagago hazunzu na mi wo ab</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 19:24">Henda yeka tanaga eyinga wo matana na mami</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">Nani henda ato gas a shi ene nyaba kudage.<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />To, kusa na aginda ani a Yesu henda, Mariyamu Yesu, na buhuwa bo Mariyamu na Mariyamu bwaa bo Kilopas, na henda Mariyamu Magadaliya, a yo pab Yesane. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Na Yesu e hya yini eb, na a swabo ane a eb e hyange kudaga yesane kusa, pa eb nyange na yini eb, &lt;&lt; Mama, bwa nabobe a bona&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Katomo eb nyange na aswabo ane, &lt;&lt; Yini nabe ana.&gt;&gt; tun na gagu uniya bu swabo buni bo zhangi amachiya a Yesu koro yabe ab.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uʻu o Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Na yesa o nani Yesu na eb e daki a hwagu ko nya, zwam a shinji ene e yo na so nassi pa eb nyange, &lt;&lt; Na on hoge tuoware to mani.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Azhe ekimbu e mai ene e yo pate iragi na mani ma sambo shinji. Pa yek a ryabyae sosu na mani ma sambo mani, atumbi na agungu a izob a wunsuma ye na yinu. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Na Yesu e rata mani ma sabo mani nyange,&lt;&lt; A hwagu!&gt;&gt; Katomo eb e kazhatumi reto re eba muhondo mo eb mo sher.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A tumbi Yesu Bando Be.bi'abo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Na ob ushi oho uni ushi oho kama kimga o Yahudawa ne, zwam a ta geya kingi gindane oho mugeta mo tandare zwam mugeta mo tandare muni mushi mo tuwaga, pa Yahudawa a kaba Bilatus a kusage bone eb, a zhangi henda kingi ka ana a owagi. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Pa ato gas ani a kore a kush buna e bot bo Jigu, na henda bot bone bwaba ginda taba na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Ama taba kore wo Yesu, yek a hya e rego e u, a kusago bune eb ba. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Pa boink bando ato gas bo tumbi Yesu na mashe, kapaba pa mahi na mani ma kumbe shiryage. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Bone bo hya iri ni henda bob ne bo zwame nani, taaje o bob henda ushi mahinda, zwam gahi ma e tane mahinda, bob henda bo daki taaje o bob ushi mahinda. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Uni henda zwam a shiji ene e yo na so nasi nezwama, &lt;&lt; u upha o Yesu ko oinka̱ a koso ba&gt;&gt;. <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Nasi o mai henda owange, &lt;&lt; Yek a yingyana bone bwaba tumbi&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shiwumba She Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Nayesa o nani Yusupu, bot bo Armatiya, ene ishi bu swabo bo bone Yesu ama na tuswen zwam ryansa re Yahudawa, e kaba Bilatus izini e zhangi kingi ka Yesu. Bilatus henda be pa ek izini, e kore henda e zhangi kingi ka Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Nikodimu henda, eb ene shi koro eb wo Yesu o Jigu na ageta ba un, e korya na mur na al'ul hutarane, ekore na iya chanage akwape tato. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Ato barya̠gya̠ a kore a zhagi kingi ka Yesu atane ek na so likapani o lili a zuta ek iyi wanshe o tusongo ete, ta alada a Yahudawa a shiwumba ange. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Pani paba ginda Yesu azhe sanga o mubwaga kusa, na so sanga o mubwaga henda azhe u'uyi one owaba tabo tana koga ba. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Shi obushi oho kama kimga ne o Yahudawa, u'uyi henda oyo kusa, pa yek a tane riʻu re Yesu pate.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu E Mashingeu Bando uʻu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />To, oho Jigu o moget mo tandare, Mariyamu Magadaliya makore uyi na obungegiya, tunshi to sayo na gagu uni, ma hya a swabkeu te uni owaba sabta yinu uyi. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />pa Mariyamu ma tonge to Magadaliya ma e be som wo Bitrus na henda aswabo ane a Yesu e kudage, mange bna ba, &lt;&lt; A zhangu Botʻbutuwaga na so uyi uni, tudaki henda wo ab tane ek ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />pa Bitrus na aswabo a bone Yesu ani a sher a be kore wo uyi uni. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Kuchi ab barya̠gya̠ a e be somo, ama aswabo ani a sugu Bitrus koro wo uyi uni. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />A be umbaga yingya na so, pa ab a hya likapani o lili iri, ama aswabo ani a eso ba. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />ka tomo Bitrus be koro na yesa o ab be eshe uyi uni, be hya likapani uni iri, <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />matana mani henda mareto re Yesu a iru mek rihuga rinka na likapani uni ba, ama a para meka mabamaba rihuga rinka. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />pa aswabo a Yesu ane a rwage esh a eshe na so taba, a hya, a tane henda so. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />Kuchi nanani yek a gano nasi uni ba, ne zwama tamahinda ne e mashinge bando ana a owagi. <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Pa aswabo a bone Yesu ani a maringe geu bando aswabo a mai.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu e Ma Chibane wo Mariyamu ma Tonge To Magadaliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Mariyamu henda maba yesane ba na so uyi ba mabeshitudaro. Mabeshi tudaro ma huka ma yingya ne uyi, <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />Pa maba mahya ato hagamba arya budagane na matana ma cheu shani wo riʻu re Yesu re yeu, bando o reto boik henda bando buna. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Pa ato hagamba ani ange na Mariyamu, &lt;&lt; Buni bo yaba zwam nya gab on tudaro?&gt;&gt; Mange na ba, &lt;&lt; Ai, a zhangu Botʻbutuwaga na bumi na daki henda wo ab tane boik ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Na Mariyamu mazwame nani pa maba ma mamabariki ma hya Yesu yesane, ama magano nezwama Yesu ba. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Yesu nyange na mariyamu, &lt;&lt; Burnibo yaba, zwama nya gab on tudaro? Ga henda gab on yirigyaga?&gt;&gt;.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:15">Zwam ma on tunane nezwama bot bo e getago e uyi ne mange na eb, &lt;&lt; Buchi bo yaba, shi gab ne bo zhangi Yesu, nezwama wo gab tane ek nai, gyam henda na kore e zhangi ek.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Yesu nyange na Mariyamu, &lt;&lt; Mariyamu!&gt;&gt; Pa maba mamabariki mange na eb na tuyahudanchi, &lt;&lt; Rabboni!&gt;&gt; Wato, Umarumi. <verse eid="JHN 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Yesu nyange na maba, &lt;&lt; Ota muhunga katomo zwam na edanduwa wo Buchi ba. Se de o karige wo ahuwa nami o zwama yek na on dande wo Buchi na bumihenda na buhi, Onhon numi henda Onhon nuhi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Pa Mariytamu mane masher na tonge to Magadaliya ma kore wo aswabo a bone Yesu mange naba, &lt;&lt; Na hya Botʻbutuwaga!&gt;&gt; Mange henda bob ne bone zwama kuchi iri ni.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu E ma Chibano Wo Aswabo a Bone Eb.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Na yesa o muget mo tandare oho o lahade oho o Jigu, na rembe mu'eso mo ubana one o aswabo a bone Yesu ayo mo yo gundagane zwam ryansa re ato tuwaga a Yahudawa, pa Yesu e kore e yinsa na so, nyange naba, &lt;&lt; Ga ashinya a bura̱̱ a nya wo gahi!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Na Yesu e zwame nani, pa eb e chibane yek wa eb na mu'abo mo eb. pa aswabo a bune eb ashi so chen na e hyanu e Botʻbutuwaga. <verse eid="JHN 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Pa Yesu e kisane zwama yek, &lt;&lt; Ashinya a bura̱̱ ayo wo gahi! Ta Buchi buna tuma gyam, nani henda gyame tuma gahi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Ta eb e zwame nani, pa eb e hurpa yek muhondo mo eb, nyange naba, &lt;&lt; E che uhunchi Onhon. <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Kuchi ana a gahi yapen turiya twaba, a yapeu yek ba un. Kuchi ana a gahi yapeu yek ba henda, a yapeu yek ba, ba uni.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Na Toma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Azhe bobe bwa ba ange Toma, boink bando ato rekwape na ryaryi ani, bone bwaba ogo shigira, eyo patiya gagu o Yesu e kore. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Pa aswabo a mai ange na eb, &lt;&lt; Tu hya Botʻbutuwaga.&gt;&gt; Ama Toma nyange naba, &lt;&lt; Shi na hya hombe o kosa na wa eb, e ta ne ebobo nimi na so hare o kosa uni, e tane henda wa numi na bi'abo be eb ba, na tano mahinda ba.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Na mugeta mo tutato har nare, aswabo a bone Yesu ab na so yaba, Toma ma eyo pate taba naba, mo eso moba gundagane, pa Yesu e koro e yinga na so, nyange, &lt;&lt; Ashinya a bura̱̱ a yo wo gahi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Katomo pa Yesu nyange na Toma, &lt;&lt; Tana ebobwa nebe pani, o hoge wa nimi. Tuta wa ne be henda o hoge bi'abo na bimi. ota sha bot bo shaka.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Toma e chane Yesu nyange, &lt;&lt; Gab Botʻbutuwaga nabumi na Onhon numi henda!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Pa Yesu nyange na Toma, &lt;&lt; Wato zwam gab na hya katomo gab tane mahinda? Iyi bura̱̱ eyo wo ana na hya ba, ama henda atanomahinda!&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ene E sa Yohana E Herange Otakarda uni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Gaguni Yesu e shiu iyahyani emai dinya na bishina̱ be aswabo a bone eb, ene ab herango na otakarda uni ba. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Ama a herange ani zwam e tane mahinda nezwama Yesu ishi Botʻbwakimga, Bwa bo Onhon Bando etano'emahinda henda e hi mohondo bando reze re eb.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu Emachibano Wo Aswabo a Bune eb a Tandare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Baya o nani, Yesu e machiibanyaka wo aswabo a bune eb na gungu o rwaga oto o Tibariya o Galili. hingyana henda ta eb e machiibanya. <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Bitrus, na Toma ene nyaba ogago bo shigira, na Nata'ala e Kana o tonge to Galili, na awo a te a Zabadi, na henda aswabo a mai a Yesu arya, kuchi ab paba bake. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Pa Bitrus bene byaba ogage Saminu byange na ato mai, &lt;&lt; Na koro e kumbago e mukemba.&gt;&gt;.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:3">Yekange, twa koro taba na gab,&gt;&gt; Pa yek sher a esh o ugu. Ama na ageta ani yek kombo konya ba. <verse eid="JHN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Na o bungonge pa yeka hya Yesu na gungu o rwaga, ama aswabo a bone eb a gano ek ba. <verse eid="JHN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Pa Yesu nyange na ba, &lt;&lt; Haragasu e kumbago mukimba?&gt;&gt; Pa yeka chane Yesu angya &lt;&lt;ko&gt;&gt;. <verse eid="JHN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Pa Yesu nyange naba, &lt;&lt; E tagya hataro nahi na wa katuga na o'ugu nya hi mukemba.&gt;&gt; Yekashi ta eb e zwame akumbage mukemba har yek amashimbi numi hataro zwam udubu o mukemba. <verse eid="JHN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Har bu swabo bote bo Yesu e hyange kudaga bwange na Bitrus, &lt;&lt; Bushi Botʻbutuwaga!&gt;&gt; Na Bitrus be hoge nezwama Botʻbutuwaga ne pa beb be buda a po a beb zwam beza a po na kingi pa beb be henagi na so mani mate. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Aswabo a mai henda a kore na so u'ugu humgani na iyakumbage a mukenba shinji na mukemba, zwam yeka za hwanye na gungu, gagu tuhwan oyo ta mapunda ma buni bura̱. <verse eid="JHN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Na e sher yaba gungu uni pa yeka hya ora pate, na ekemba zaat na henda kapuka. <verse eid="JHN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Pa Yesu nyange naba, &lt;&lt;Panaji mo mai mukemba pani mone mo gahi kumbage yanzu.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Pa Saminu ene ab ugage Bitrus e hyane e'ugu, e numi iyakumbage na gungu, shinji na mukemba mo tuwaga buni na akwape ta na mo tato. Ama kuchi na udubu o mob nani, iyakumbage ani ama hando ba. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Pa Yesu nyange na ba &lt;&lt;Kuranji e kare.&gt;&gt; Wo aswabo ani henda aza bone bo madamo bo kaba Yesu ko eb ishi ga, zwam yek a gano eb ishi Botʻbutuwaga. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Pa Yesu e kore e zhangi kapuka, e pa yek, nani henda ekemba.<verse eid="JHN 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Uni oboshi koro tato o Yesu emakimga chibane wo aswabo a bone eb yesa owanshiga eb bando ana a owagi.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sha rihuba Retami Nimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Naba re kuryago pa Yesu nyange na Bitrus, &lt;&lt; Bitrus bwa bo Yohana, bo hyange ato ani tukudago na tumi?&gt;&gt; Bitrus byange na Yesu, &lt;&lt;I gab Botʻbutuwaga, bo daki nezwama e bu kudage.&gt;&gt; Yesu nyange na Bitrus, &lt;&lt; Oryagatume redomaga nami.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Pa Yesu e kabaka Bitrus e kaba e ryaryi, &lt;&lt; Bitrus bwa bo Yohana, bona kudage?&gt;&gt; Bitrus byange na Yesu, &lt;&lt; I Botʻbutuwaga, bo daki nezwama e bu kudage&gt;&gt; Yesu nyange na beb, &lt;&lt; Ushi rihuba retami nimi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Yesu nyange na Bitrus ezwamo e tato, &lt;&lt; Bitrus bwa bo Yohana, bona kudage gyam tamahinda?&gt;&gt; Pa Bitrus bi shi so shiri zwam e zwamo ete e tato nyange, &lt;&lt; Bona kudage?&gt;&gt; Beb henda byange na Yesu, &lt;&lt; Gab Botʻbutuwaga, ai, budaki konya kuchi, bo daki henda nezwama nabo kudage.&gt;&gt; Yesu nyange na Bitrus, &lt;&lt; Ushi rihuba retami nimi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Lelle tamahinda, na on kabo zwammagaa, gagu o turagasu natobe bo on kama shagi damura, o karige wo gab kudage, ama shi bu rwago onge, bwa tuta wa nebe bot mai bo bushagi damura, bo bushibke wo gab kudagewa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />Yesu e zwame iri ni zwam e daki ta beb bya u owasa a dande Onhon, ta Yesu e zwame nani, Yesu nyange na Bitrus, &lt;&lt; Naswabya&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Na Aswabo Ane a Eb Ekudage Dinya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Na Bitrus bema barki be hya bu swabo bone bo Yesu e kudage dinya bobe swabe yek, wato bone bo yo kusa na Yesu gagu ere kuryago kone ko eb nyange, &lt;&lt; Gab Botʻbutuwaga, ga bwa bo tuta gab?&gt;&gt;. <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Na Bitrus be hya Yahuda, pa beb byange na Yesu, &lt;&lt; Gab Botʻbutuwaga, bot buni now?&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Yesu e chen ek nyange, &lt;&lt; Shi na kudago ek e nya na muhondo, ingaruwa no be? Na swabya.<verse eid="JHN 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Zwam nanani taaje o te o gatagago kopa bando ahuwa, nezwama bu swabo bote bwa u ba. Ama henda Yesu e zwamo nezwama nya u ba, Yesu de e zwamo, &lt;&lt; Shi na kudago e nya na muhondo har na kurwa, inga ruwanobe?&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Ebe shi buswabo bone bo on taaje o iri ni, bone henda bo herange ek, henda tu daki ene bob bo zwame ishi mahinda.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Taje o Akundaga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Yanzu azhe iyi dinya ene e Yesu ishi. Shi kuchi eyo yerange ink-ink, nazache ko duniya kuchi o pwa zhagi hatakarda ane ab heranga aik ba.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>